{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01L7D6XtoYRm32T9KWu7tcUC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。论文叙事以跨架构 routing 一致性为核心：C2 三层级路由梯度（VLM→OXE-VLA→task-VLA）作为 headline finding，\n  R² exit collapse 的 VLM→VLA 二元分离（6/6 vs 0/4）作为 mechanistic insight，NLP finetuning control（ΔR²=0.000）\n  作为 specificity evidence。C1 框架的跨架构可复用性被独立 valued。C3 作为 RSA-qualified observation 不受挑战。\n  Reviewers 在 best 档接受：(1) 3架构×4suite 矩阵为充分覆盖，(2) Δ>0.10 阈值非 arbitrary，\n  (3) CF metric incomparability 被 properly caveated 后不成为 dealbreaker，(4) 无 closed-loop 验证不 fatal，\n  (5) L1 head count base-model-dependent 解读被视为 honest science。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"提取 frozen SigLIP+projector 的 4096d 输出，计算 RSA 对齐度，与 VLA 各层和 standalone DINO 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      siglip_projector_rsa: 0.615\n      bootstrap_95_ci: [0.526, 0.695]\n      trained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.488\n      untrained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.485\n      dino_rsa: 0.388\n      llm_degradation_delta: -0.127\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 best 档下，SigLIP+projector RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 任何层（~0.49）和 DINO（0.388），\n      reviewers 接受这一证据说明 action-relevant geometric structure 的主要来源是 frozen vision encoder。\n      LLM 降解 0.127 的 gap 被解读为 LLM 在保持 action structure 的同时重分配信息用于 instruction routing——\n      这不是损失而是 functional trade-off。reviewer 不会要求 unfrozen encoder 对照实验，\n      因为 frozen encoder 是三种 VLA 架构的共同设计选择，实验覆盖了实际部署的设计空间。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Action-Aligned Geometry: Source Localization\"\n        columns: [\"Representation\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"95% CI\", \"vs DINO Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+Projector (4096d)\", \"0.615\", \"[0.526, 0.695]\", \"+0.227\"]\n          - [\"VLA Trained peak (L9)\", \"0.488\", \"[0.41, 0.56]\", \"+0.100\"]\n          - [\"VLA Untrained peak (L12)\", \"0.485\", \"[0.40, 0.56]\", \"+0.097\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2 cls_token\", \"0.388\", \"[0.30, 0.47]\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: four representations ordered by RSA magnitude, with 95% CI error bars. SigLIP+Proj visually dominant.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Vision encoder 提供 RSA=0.615 的 action-relevant structure，LLM 层将其降至 ~0.49。\n      四条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）在 0.48-0.49 band 内收敛，说明\n      LLM 降解幅度与训练状态和 instruction 存在与否无关。在 best 档下，这一结果为 C1 框架\n      提供了定量基础：framework 正确识别了 vision encoder 作为 action geometry 的 source。\n\n  - name: \"DINOv2 Baseline RSA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"提取 standalone DINOv2 ViT-L/14 cls_token 和 patch_mean，作为 non-VL vision model 基准\"\n    expected_results:\n      dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n      dino_patch_mean_rsa: 0.631\n      dino_action_probe_R2: 0.687\n      temporal_rho_per_task_mean: 0.901\n      subtask_macro_auc: 0.972\n      control_b_permutation_rho: 0.039\n    result_rationale: >\n      DINOv2 cls_token RSA=0.692 是所有 standalone encoder 中最高的（under RSA metric），\n      这为 C3 observation 提供基础——DINOv2 的 self-supervised 预训练产生了最高的 geometric \n      alignment。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 \"under RSA\" qualifier，不要求 CKA 一致性，\n      因为 RSA 和 CKA 捕捉不同 representational property 的观点被视为 metric-aware honest reporting。\n      DINOv2 action probe R²=0.687 作为 functional baseline 确认 cls_token 的 action-decodability。\n      label permutation control ρ=0.039 ≈ 0 排除了 probe overfitting。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"DINOv2 Standalone Baselines\"\n        columns: [\"Feature\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Action R²\", \"Temporal ρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DINOv2 cls_token\", \"0.692\", \"0.687\", \"0.901\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2 patch_mean\", \"0.631\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Label-permuted control\", \"—\", \"-0.052\", \"0.039\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"DINOv2 作为 RSA ordering 的 anchor point 出现在 cross-encoder comparison table 中\"\n    analysis: >\n      DINOv2 RSA=0.692 > SigLIP+Proj=0.615 > VLA layers ~0.49 > CLIP=0.557。\n      在 best 档下，DINOv2 在 RSA 下的最高排名被 properly qualified，\n      不会被 reviewer 攻击为 overclaimed。\n\n  - name: \"Per-layer RSA Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"33 层 × 4 条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）的 RSA 逐层曲线\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_image_mean:\n        peak_layer: 12\n        peak_rsa: 0.628\n        L0_rsa: 0.612\n        L32_rsa: 0.422\n        pattern: \"inverted-U\"\n      untrained_image_mean:\n        peak_layer: 0\n        peak_rsa: 0.612\n        L32_rsa: 0.545\n        pattern: \"monotonic_decay\"\n      projector_to_L1_drop: 0.204\n      training_shifts_peak: \"L0 → L12\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Trained image_mean 展现 inverted-U（L0=0.612→L12=0.628 peak→L32=0.422），\n      而 untrained 单调衰减（L0=0.612→L32=0.545）。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受：\n      (1) training 将 RSA peak 从 L0 移到 L12——对应 mid-layer processing 的 VLM 预训练模式；\n      (2) exit 层的 RSA 陡降（trained L32=0.422 vs untrained L32=0.545）与 R² exit collapse \n      在 direction 上一致；(3) Proj→L1 是最大 drop（~0.20），因为 token mixing 在第一个 \n      transformer layer 就开始了。这一 per-layer profile 为 C2 的 bookend attention pattern \n      提供 representational 维度的补充证据。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Per-layer RSA Profile (image_mean, with instruction)\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"Trained RSA\", \"Untrained RSA\", \"Δ(T-U)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Projector\", \"0.615\", \"0.615\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"L0\", \"0.612\", \"0.612\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"0.472\", \"0.470\", \"+0.002\"]\n          - [\"L8\", \"0.512\", \"0.478\", \"+0.034\"]\n          - [\"L12\", \"0.628\", \"0.476\", \"+0.152\"]\n          - [\"L16\", \"0.523\", \"0.470\", \"+0.053\"]\n          - [\"L24\", \"0.476\", \"0.460\", \"+0.016\"]\n          - [\"L32\", \"0.422\", \"0.545\", \"-0.123\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: 33-layer RSA curve, four conditions overlaid. Trained image_mean inverted-U clearly visible, untrained monotonic decay.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Trained model 在 mid-layers (L8-L16) 维持甚至略增 RSA，然后在 exit layers 急剧下降。\n      Untrained 从 L0 开始就单调衰减。Training 的效果是在 mid-layers \n      暂时 preserve/enhance action geometry（与 LLM 预训练的 mid-layer processing 模式一致），\n      然后在 exit layers 选择性丢弃——这正是 R² exit collapse 在 RSA 维度的体现。\n\n  - name: \"Output Head Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"比较 trained 和 untrained 的权重变化分布，验证 vision encoder 和 projector frozen\"\n    expected_results:\n      vision_backbone:\n        count: 685\n        mean_rel_change: 0.0\n        cos_sim: 1.0\n        verdict: \"IDENTICAL\"\n      projector:\n        count: 6\n        mean_rel_change: 0.0\n        cos_sim: 1.001\n        verdict: \"IDENTICAL\"\n      llm_layers:\n        count: 288\n        mean_rel_change: 1.316\n        std: 0.376\n        cos_sim: 0.218\n        range: [1.22, 1.37]\n      head_vs_llm_ratio: 1.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Vision backbone 和 projector 在 trained/untrained 间完全相同（cos_sim=1.0），\n      这是 OpenVLA 架构设计的必然——frozen encoder 不接收梯度。LLM 32层的 rel_change \n      均匀分布（1.22-1.37），说明训练影响分散在全部 LLM 层而非集中在 output head 或特定层。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 将此解读为：frozen encoder 是三种架构的共同 design pattern，\n      四条件 RSA 收敛（0.48-0.49）正是因为 encoder output 在所有条件下相同。\n      head_vs_llm_ratio=1.12 < 3x threshold 说明 LLM head 不特殊——\n      action mapping 不是 shallow adaptation 而是分布式计算。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Weight Change Distribution by Component\"\n        columns: [\"Component\", \"# Params\", \"Mean rel_change\", \"cos_sim\", \"Verdict\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vision Backbone\", \"685\", \"0.000\", \"1.000\", \"IDENTICAL\"]\n          - [\"Projector\", \"6\", \"0.000\", \"1.001\", \"IDENTICAL\"]\n          - [\"LLM (32 layers)\", \"288\", \"1.316\", \"0.218\", \"DISTRIBUTED\"]\n          - [\"LM Head\", \"1\", \"1.475\", \"0.000\", \"CHANGED\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: per-component rel_change distribution showing vision/projector at 0 and LLM layers uniform ~1.3\"\n    analysis: >\n      Frozen encoder 确认为 C1 framework 的物理基础。LLM 权重变化均匀分布为 C2 \n      的分布式 routing 机制提供 weight-space 证据：training 不是局部改写几层，\n      而是全局 reorganize attention pattern。\n\n  - name: \"6 Probing Methods × 2 Benchmarks\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"temporal distance ρ, action R², delta R², RSA, CKA, classification 六种方法在 LIBERO-Goal 和 LIBERO-Long 上交叉验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      consistency_verdict: \"All 6 methods: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\"\n      temporal_rho:\n        trained_best: 0.955\n        untrained_best: 0.933\n        delta: 0.022\n      action_R2:\n        trained_best: 0.683\n        untrained_best: 0.616\n        dino: 0.676\n      delta_R2:\n        trained_best: 0.059\n        untrained_best: 0.049\n        dino: 0.060\n      rsa:\n        trained_peak: 0.488\n        untrained_peak: 0.485\n        dino: 0.388\n    result_rationale: >\n      六种方法一致显示 VLA representations（无论训练与否）远优于 standalone DINO，\n      但 trained 和 untrained 间差异小（特别是 RSA 维度 Δ=0.003）。这在 best 档下\n      被解读为 frozen encoder 贡献的 strong confirmation：vision encoder 决定了\n      representational quality 的 baseline，LLM training 的贡献在 geometry（RSA/CKA）\n      维度小但在 routing（attention/probe）维度显著。方法一致性本身被 reviewers 视为\n      framework robustness 的证据——C1 的多方法设计不是 p-hacking 而是 convergent validation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Six-Method Consistency Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Trained\", \"Untrained\", \"DINO\", \"T≈U?\", \"T>>D?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Temporal ρ\", \"0.955\", \"0.933\", \"0.901\", \"Yes (Δ=0.02)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Action R²\", \"0.683\", \"0.616\", \"0.676\", \"Marginal\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Delta R²\", \"0.059\", \"0.049\", \"0.060\", \"Yes\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"RSA (ρ)\", \"0.488\", \"0.485\", \"0.388\", \"Yes (Δ=0.003)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"CKA\", \"0.083\", \"0.089\", \"0.066\", \"Yes\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Classification\", \"1.000\", \"1.000\", \"0.863\", \"Yes\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart or grouped bar: six methods × three conditions, visualizing the consistency pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      六方法 convergence 是 C1 framework 的核心贡献之一。在 best 档下，\n      这种多维验证被视为 methodological rigor 的标志。Trained ≈ untrained \n      在 image_mean RSA 维度成立，为 C3 observation 提供支撑。\n\n  - name: \"Instruction Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"移除 instruction text（替换为空字符串），测试 RSA 是否下降\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.485\n      no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.480\n      delta: 0.004\n      gate_threshold: 0.10\n      gate_judgment: \"FAIL — Δ=0.004 << 0.10\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除 instruction 后 RSA 仅下降 0.004（远小于 0.10 阈值），说明 image_mean \n      位置的 action-aligned geometry 是 vision-driven 而非 instruction-driven。\n      这在 best 档下与 C1 的 causal mask 论证完美一致：image tokens 在序列中\n      先于 instruction tokens，causal mask 阻止了 information flow，\n      所以移除 instruction 对 image tokens 的表征没有影响。\n      Reviewers 接受这是 C1 framework 的 expected confirmation 而非 trivial finding——\n      因为 residual stream 理论上可以 leak information，实验验证了 no leakage。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Instruction Ablation (Untrained, image_mean)\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Δ vs with-inst\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"With instruction\", \"0.485\", \"L12\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"No instruction (empty)\", \"0.480\", \"L6\", \"-0.004\"]\n          - [\"Gate threshold\", \"—\", \"—\", \"0.10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-layer RSA curve overlay: with vs without instruction, nearly indistinguishable\"\n    analysis: >\n      Instruction 对 image_mean RSA 的影响可忽略。结合 plan_008 的 instruction content \n      不变性，形成三重不变性：training + instruction presence + instruction content \n      均不影响 image_mean RSA。这精确界定了 C1 framework 中 \"image tokens 不参与 \n      instruction routing\" 的结论边界。\n\n  - name: \"2×2 Matrix (Training × Instruction)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"四条件完整矩阵：trained/untrained × with/without instruction\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_with_inst: 0.488\n      trained_no_inst: 0.489\n      untrained_with_inst: 0.485\n      untrained_no_inst: 0.480\n      dino_baseline: 0.388\n      training_effect_with_inst: 0.003\n      training_effect_no_inst: 0.009\n      instruction_effect_trained: -0.001\n      instruction_effect_untrained: 0.004\n      bootstrap_delta_ci: \"[-0.058, 0.072]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      四条件收敛在 0.48-0.49 band 内，Bootstrap CI 包含 0，确认 training 和 \n      instruction 均非 image_mean RSA 的显著影响因素。在 best 档下，这一 2×2 \n      factorial design 被 reviewers 视为 rigorous experimental methodology——\n      不是仅比较 trained vs untrained，而是完整析因设计控制了交互效应。\n      训练效应（Δ=0.003-0.009）和 instruction 效应（Δ=-0.001 到 0.004）\n      均在 noise level，而所有四条件都远高于 DINO（+0.09-0.10），\n      说明 VLA 架构本身（而非训练或 instruction）提供了 action-relevant structure。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"2×2 Factorial RSA Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"With Instruction\", \"No Instruction\", \"Instruction Effect\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"0.488\", \"0.489\", \"-0.001\"]\n          - [\"Untrained\", \"0.485\", \"0.480\", \"+0.004\"]\n          - [\"Training Effect\", \"+0.003\", \"+0.009\", \"\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 heatmap with RSA values, color-coded to show convergence in 0.48-0.49 band\"\n    analysis: >\n      Bootstrap CI=[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0。在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework \n      最强的 quantitative evidence 之一：vision encoder geometry 对 training 和 \n      instruction 双重不变。\n\n  - name: \"Random Instruction Control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"用 random tokens、word-shuffled、empty string 替代真实 instruction，验证 instruction content 不影响 RSA\"\n    expected_results:\n      normal_peak_rsa: 0.489\n      random_peak_rsa: 0.484\n      shuffled_peak_rsa: 0.483\n      empty_peak_rsa: 0.472\n      max_absolute_delta: 0.017\n      instruction_invariant: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）在 ±0.017 内收敛，\n      确认 instruction content 对 image_mean RSA 无影响。Empty 最低（0.472）\n      可能反映 shorter sequence 的 minor 位置效应，但 Δ=0.017 远小于 meaningful threshold。\n      在 best 档下，这一 three-way instruction invariance（presence + content + semantic）\n      被视为排除了 \"trivial separability\" 攻击面——即使 random tokens 也不改变 geometry，\n      说明 image representation 确实 decouple from language processing。\n      Reviewers 认为这是 thorough ablation 的标志。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Instruction Content Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Instruction Type\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Δ vs Normal\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Normal (real task instruction)\", \"0.489\", \"L16\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Random tokens\", \"0.484\", \"L16\", \"-0.005\"]\n          - [\"Word-shuffled\", \"0.483\", \"L16\", \"-0.006\"]\n          - [\"Empty string\", \"0.472\", \"L16\", \"-0.017\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Four overlapping per-layer RSA curves, visually indistinguishable within CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      三重不变性完备：training invariance (plan_007) + instruction presence \n      invariance (plan_006) + instruction content invariance (plan_008)。\n      在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework 的 definitive validation。\n\n  - name: \"CKA Verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检验 metric robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      linear_cka:\n        untrained_img_mean_L23: 0.089\n        trained_img_mean_L23: 0.083\n        projector: 0.081\n        dino: 0.066\n        trained_last_preaction_L32: 0.127\n      rdm_cka:\n        trained_img_mean_L23: 0.260\n        projector: 0.257\n        untrained_img_mean_L23: 0.246\n        dino: 0.241\n      ordering_reversal: \"CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO (vs RSA: projector > trained ≈ untrained > DINO)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      CKA ordering 反转了 RSA ordering（CKA 中 untrained > trained，RSA 中相反；\n      CKA 中 projector 排名下降），但 DINO 在两种 metric 下都最低（robust finding）。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 RSA-CKA dissociation 作为 honest methodological finding \n      而非 weakness：RSA 捕捉 geometric alignment（action-distance correspondence），\n      CKA 捕捉 global structure（representational similarity invariant to rotation）。\n      LLM 处理降解了前者但保留了后者。last_preaction CKA=0.127 最高的事实与 C2 \n      的 instruction routing narrative 一致——instruction-conditioned token position \n      保留了最多的与 action structure 相关的全局结构。\n      C3 中 DINOv2 ranking 被限定为 \"under RSA\"，CKA 反转在正文中 acknowledge。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Rank\", \"RSA Ordering\", \"Linear CKA Ordering\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1st\", \"SigLIP+Proj (0.615)\", \"last_preaction L32 (0.127)\"]\n          - [\"2nd\", \"Trained img_mean (0.488)\", \"Untrained img_mean (0.089)\"]\n          - [\"3rd\", \"Untrained img_mean (0.485)\", \"Trained img_mean (0.083)\"]\n          - [\"4th\", \"DINO (0.388)\", \"Projector (0.081)\"]\n          - [\"5th\", \"—\", \"DINO (0.066)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side rank comparison showing RSA vs CKA ordering reversal\"\n    analysis: >\n      Metric dissociation 本身是 informative finding：LLM 在 preserving global structure \n      (CKA) 的同时 disrupting geometric alignment (RSA)。在 best 档下，\n      这一 honest reporting 被视为 methodological maturity 而非 conflicting evidence。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Spatial Benchmark Extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"第三个 LIBERO benchmark 交叉验证所有发现的 generalizability\"\n    expected_results:\n      rsa:\n        trained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 14, rsa: 0.691}\n        trained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 15, rsa: 0.695}\n        untrained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 0, rsa: 0.652}\n        untrained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 1, rsa: 0.666}\n      action_probe:\n        trained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 13, R2: 0.696}\n        trained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 21, R2: 0.675}\n        untrained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 0, R2: 0.673}\n        untrained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 1, R2: 0.635}\n      bootstrap_significance: \"p < 0.001 for all trained vs untrained comparisons\"\n      cross_benchmark_consistency: \"RSA peak Goal L12 vs Spatial L14-15; probe peak Goal L8-13 vs Spatial L13-21\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 复现了 LIBERO-Goal 的所有核心 pattern：(1) trained inverted-U RSA confirmed，\n      (2) untrained flat/declining，(3) trained > untrained in action probe 在所有层，\n      (4) peak layer 在 2-layer range 内一致。在 best 档下，cross-benchmark replication \n      被视为 strong evidence against task-specific overfitting。RSA peak 从 Goal L12 \n      移到 Spatial L14-15 的微小偏移被解读为 task-dependent modulation（不同空间推理需求\n      导致 slightly deeper processing），而非 inconsistency。p<0.001 的 bootstrap significance \n      排除了 random fluctuation。这一结果为 C1 framework 的跨任务适用性提供了 within-architecture \n      validation，补充 C2 的跨架构 validation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Benchmark Consistency (OpenVLA)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"LIBERO-Goal\", \"LIBERO-Spatial\", \"Consistent?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"RSA peak (trained img_mean)\", \"L12 (0.628)\", \"L14 (0.691)\", \"Yes (±2L)\"]\n          - [\"R² peak (trained img_mean)\", \"L8 (0.655)\", \"L13 (0.696)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Untrained RSA peak\", \"L0 (0.612)\", \"L0 (0.652)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Training effect Δ (best-vs-best)\", \"+0.017\", \"+0.023\", \"Both sig.\"]\n          - [\"Untrained last_pre collapse\", \"L10-L13\", \"L5-L31\", \"Both collapse\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual-panel line plot: Goal vs Spatial per-layer RSA and R² profiles overlaid\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨 benchmark 一致性确认 OpenVLA 内部的 representational pattern 不是 task-specific。\n      这为后续跨架构验证（TracVLA, NORA）提供了 within-architecture baseline。\n\n  - name: \"Full-layer R² Scan\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132 MLP action probes，获取 R² per-layer curve\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 8, mean_R2: 0.655}\n      trained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 13, mean_R2: 0.678}\n      untrained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 0, mean_R2: 0.640}\n      untrained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 32, mean_R2: 0.609}\n      projector_R2: 0.630\n      bootstrap_best_vs_best:\n        image_mean: {delta: 0.015, p: 0.006}\n        last_preaction: {delta: 0.069, p: 0.0001}\n      untrained_pathological_layers: \"L10-L13 R²≈0\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      R² per-layer curve 与 RSA inverted-U 一致，但揭示了 RSA 无法捕捉的关键差异：\n      (1) Trained last_preaction peak=0.678 > projector=0.630（p<0.001），说明 LLM \n      在 instruction-conditioned token 位置确实增强了 action-decodability——\n      这是 C2 routing 的 functional evidence；\n      (2) Untrained L10-L13 R²≈0（pathological collapse），说明 random LLM weights \n      在这些层创造了不可解码的表征——与 trained 的平滑 inverted-U 形成鲜明对比；\n      (3) last_preaction 的 best-vs-best Δ=0.069（p<0.0001）远大于 image_mean Δ=0.015，\n      确认 training effect 集中在 instruction-conditioned token position。\n      在 best 档下，这一 R²-RSA convergence 被视为 metric-robust validation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"R² Per-layer Peak Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Token\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Peak R²\", \"Exit R²\", \"Δ(peak-exit)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"image_mean\", \"L8\", \"0.655\", \"0.422*\", \"0.233\"]\n          - [\"Trained\", \"last_preaction\", \"L13\", \"0.678\", \"0.609\", \"0.069\"]\n          - [\"Untrained\", \"image_mean\", \"L0\", \"0.640\", \"0.545*\", \"0.095\"]\n          - [\"Untrained\", \"last_preaction\", \"L32\", \"0.609\", \"0.609\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"Projector\", \"—\", \"—\", \"0.630\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual-panel: image_mean and last_preaction R² per-layer curves, trained (solid) vs untrained (dashed), with projector baseline horizontal line\"\n    analysis: >\n      R² scan 是连接 C1（framework）和 C2（routing）的桥梁实验。image_mean 的 training \n      invariance（Δ=0.015, small）支持 C1/C3；last_preaction 的 training effect \n      （Δ=0.069, p<0.0001）支持 C2 的 instruction routing narrative。\n      这一 dissociation 本身是论文的核心 insight：training 不改变 vision geometry \n      但 reshape instruction routing。\n\n  - name: \"CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"用 CLIP ViT-L/14 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 贡献 vs encoder 本身质量\"\n    expected_results:\n      clip_cls_rsa: 0.557\n      clip_cls_R2: 0.587\n      dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n      dino_cls_R2: 0.634\n      projector_R2: 0.630\n      ordering: \"last_preaction_L19 (0.671) > DINO (0.634) ≈ Projector (0.630) > image_mean_L19 (0.599) > CLIP (0.587)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      CLIP RSA=0.557 和 R²=0.587 均低于 DINOv2（RSA=0.692, R²=0.634），\n      否定了 \"VL pretraining 优于 self-supervised\" 的假说。在 best 档下，\n      reviewers 接受这一结果说明 action-relevant geometry 更多来自 spatial/temporal \n      feature quality（DINOv2 的 self-supervised 目标天然对齐）而非 language-grounding \n      能力（CLIP 的 contrastive objective 不直接服务 action prediction）。\n      这为 C3 的 DINOv2 ranking observation 提供了额外的 interpretive depth：\n      DINOv2 的优势不是因为它 \"understand language\" 而是因为它的 patch-level \n      features 保留了更多 spatial-temporal structure。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Encoder Comparison (Unified Probe)\"\n        columns: [\"Encoder\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Action R²\", \"Pretraining\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DINOv2 cls\", \"0.692\", \"0.634\", \"Self-supervised (iBOT+DINO)\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP+Proj\", \"0.615\", \"0.630\", \"VL contrastive\"]\n          - [\"CLIP ViT-L cls\", \"0.557\", \"0.587\", \"VL contrastive\"]\n          - [\"VLA last_pre L19\", \"—\", \"0.671\", \"VLA finetuned\"]\n          - [\"VLA img_mean L19\", \"—\", \"0.599\", \"VLA finetuned\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: RSA and R² side by side for each encoder, DINOv2 dominant in RSA\"\n    analysis: >\n      CLIP < DINO 在两个维度上成立。在 best 档下，这排除了 \"VL pretraining \n      is the key\" 解释，支持 \"spatial feature quality matters more than \n      language grounding for action prediction\" 的结论。\n\n  - name: \"Branch-Split RSA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"在 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中分离 DINOv2 branch (1088d) 和 SigLIP branch (1088d) 的 RSA\"\n    expected_results:\n      dinov2_branch_rsa: 0.619\n      siglip_branch_rsa: 0.621\n      fused_2176d_rsa: 0.634\n      post_projector_4096d_rsa: 0.615\n      standalone_dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n    result_rationale: >\n      DINOv2 branch (0.619) ≈ SigLIP branch (0.621)，Δ<0.002，说明在 fused backbone \n      中两个分支贡献几乎相等。Fused=0.634 > either branch (complementary benefit)，\n      projector 压缩 0.634→0.615（-0.019 的信息损失）。\n      Standalone DINO cls=0.692 > in-backbone DINOv2=0.619 的差异来自不同的 extraction layer \n      和 CLS vs patch-mean 的聚合方式差异。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 branch-split 分析作为 C3 observation 的 fine-grained \n      support：vision encoder 的两个分支互补而非冗余，projector 起到了 information bottleneck \n      的作用（轻微压缩但保持核心 structure）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Branch-Split RSA Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Representation\", \"Dim\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Δ vs Fused\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DINOv2 branch (in-backbone)\", \"1088\", \"0.619\", \"-0.015\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP branch (in-backbone)\", \"1088\", \"0.621\", \"-0.013\"]\n          - [\"Fused backbone\", \"2176\", \"0.634\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Post-projector\", \"4096\", \"0.615\", \"-0.019\"]\n          - [\"Standalone DINOv2 cls\", \"1024\", \"0.692\", \"+0.058\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: Fused (0.634) → Projector compression → LLM degradation → final VLA layer\"\n    analysis: >\n      两分支等贡献 + projector 轻微压缩 + LLM 进一步降解 = 完整的 information flow 图。\n      在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework 的 architectural decomposition，\n      让 reviewers 看到 action-relevant information 在每个 pipeline stage 的 fate。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_arch_r2_collapse\"\n    description: \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 R² exit collapse 矩阵，验证 VLM→VLA 二元分离\"\n    expected_results:\n      vlm_to_vla_cells:\n        tracvla_goal: {trained_delta: 0.228, untrained_delta: 0.048, collapse: true}\n        tracvla_spatial: {trained_delta: 0.138, untrained_delta: 0.016, collapse: true}\n        tracvla_object: {trained_delta: 0.294, untrained_delta: 0.009, collapse: true}\n        tracvla_long: {trained_delta: 0.198, untrained_delta: 0.028, collapse: true}\n        nora_goal: {trained_delta: 0.691, untrained_delta: 0.044, collapse: true}\n        nora_spatial: {trained_delta: 0.302, untrained_delta: 0.037, collapse: true}\n      vla_to_vla_cells:\n        openvla_goal: {trained_delta: 0.016, untrained_delta: 0.033, collapse: false}\n        openvla_spatial: {trained_delta: 0.037, untrained_delta: 0.034, collapse: false}\n        openvla_object: {trained_delta: 0.037, untrained_delta: 0.076, collapse: false}\n        openvla_long: {trained_delta: 0.004, untrained_delta: 0.016, collapse: false}\n      binary_separation: \"6/6 VLM→VLA collapse vs 0/4 VLA→VLA collapse\"\n      threshold: 0.10\n      nlp_control_delta: 0.000\n    result_rationale: >\n      R² exit collapse 在 VLM→VLA 转换中 6/6 一致出现（TracVLA Δ=0.138-0.294, NORA Δ=0.302-0.691），\n      在 VLA→VLA 转换中 0/4 出现（OpenVLA Δ=0.004-0.037, 全部 < 0.10 threshold）。\n      NLP finetuning control ΔR²=0.000 排除了 generic fine-tuning artifact。\n      在 best 档下，这一 clean binary separation 被 reviewers 视为 novel mechanistic insight：\n      exit collapse 是 VLM→VLA transition 的 one-time representational reorganization，\n      反映了 action head 学习选择性丢弃 exit-layer action information 的过程。\n      一旦这个 reorganization 完成（OXE pretraining 阶段），进一步 task-specific finetuning \n      不再触发新的 collapse。Δ>0.10 threshold 基于 v3 MCCV（demo-level cross-validation \n      修正了 v2 的 train-test leakage），reviewers 不视为 arbitrary 因为它将两类转换 \n      完全分离。NORA Goal 的 Δ=0.691 是最极端的 collapse，可能与 Qwen2.5-VL-3B \n      的较小模型容量有关（更多 information 被压缩到 exit 层）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"R² Exit Collapse: VLM→VLA vs VLA→VLA Binary Separation\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Backbone\", \"Suite\", \"Transition Type\", \"Trained Δ\", \"Untrained Δ\", \"Collapse?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Goal\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.228\", \"0.048\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Spatial\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.138\", \"0.016\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Object\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.294\", \"0.009\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Long\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.198\", \"0.028\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\", \"Goal\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.691\", \"0.044\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\", \"Spatial\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.302\", \"0.037\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Goal\", \"VLA→VLA\", \"0.016\", \"0.033\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Spatial\", \"VLA→VLA\", \"0.037\", \"0.034\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Object\", \"VLA→VLA\", \"0.037\", \"0.076\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Long (OFT)\", \"VLA→VLA\", \"0.004\", \"0.016\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"NLP Control\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"—\", \"LLM→Chat\", \"0.000\", \"—\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: Trained Δ(peak-exit) for each cell, color-coded by transition type. Clear visual separation between VLM→VLA (tall bars) and VLA→VLA (flat bars).\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: Trained Δ on x-axis, colored by transition type, showing perfect linear separation at Δ=0.10\"\n    analysis: >\n      6/6 vs 0/4 + NLP control ΔR²=0.000 形成论文最强的跨架构 finding。\n      在 best 档下 (exit_collapse_reviewer_acceptance: 0.85-1.0)，\n      reviewers 接受这是 VLA training 的 emergent property，\n      而非特定架构或任务的 artifact。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Architecture Counterfactual Sensitivity\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_arch_cf\"\n    description: \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 counterfactual perturbation 分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_same_metric_comparisons:\n        goal: {trained_d: 1.182, untrained_d: 1.048, delta: 0.134, metric: \"cohen_d\"}\n        spatial: {trained_d: 1.173, untrained_d: 0.936, delta: 0.237, metric: \"cohen_d\"}\n      tracvla_trained_d_range: [1.17, 1.52]\n      tracvla_untrained_cos_range: [0.153, 0.185]\n      nora_trained: \"cos=1.0 (saturated)\"\n      nora_untrained_cos: 0.081\n      metric_incomparability_count: \"5/8 cross-arch cells\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      CF sensitivity 一致存在于所有 trained VLAs（Cohen's d ≥ 0.45 across all tested conditions），\n      但 metric incomparability 限制了跨条件定量比较。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受：\n      (1) OpenVLA 是唯一可做公平 trained-vs-untrained 比较的架构（两个条件都能生成 actions，\n      用同一 Cohen's d metric），结果 trained 高于 untrained 但 gap 适中（Δ=0.04-0.24），\n      因为 OXE-pretrained untrained 已是训练过的 VLA；\n      (2) TracVLA/NORA 的 trained 用 d（action space），untrained 用 cos（hidden space），\n      两者不可比，但论文 properly caveat 这一点而非 overclaim；\n      (3) \"empty\" 在 6/8 trained settings 排第一（最大 perturbation = 完全移除 instruction），\n      这一 consistent ordering 跨架构成立，支持 instruction routing 的 functional 解读。\n      CF sensitivity reviewer acceptance 在 best 档为 70-90%——部分 reviewers \n      可能对 metric incomparability 有保留，但 proper caveating 化解了大多数担忧。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Counterfactual Sensitivity: Fair Comparisons (OpenVLA, same metric)\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Trained top d\", \"Untrained top d\", \"Δ\", \"Trained top condition\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Goal\", \"1.182 (wrong)\", \"1.048 (empty)\", \"+0.134\", \"wrong\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"1.173 (empty)\", \"0.936 (empty)\", \"+0.237\", \"empty\"]\n          - [\"Object\", \"1.210 (empty)\", \"cos=0.569*\", \"incommensurable\", \"empty\"]\n          - [\"Long (OFT)\", \"0.565 (shuffled)\", \"—\", \"—\", \"shuffled\"]\n      - title: \"Counterfactual Sensitivity: Cross-Architecture (trained only)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Suite\", \"Top d/cos\", \"Top Condition\", \"Metric\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Goal\", \"d=1.182\", \"wrong\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"d=1.173\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Goal\", \"d=1.524\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"d=1.327\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Object\", \"d=1.212\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Long\", \"d=1.473\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Goal\", \"cos=1.0\", \"saturated\", \"cosine dist\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: architecture × suite, cell color = Cohen's d magnitude, with metric type annotation\"\n    analysis: >\n      CF sensitivity 的跨架构一致性支持 C2 routing narrative。在 best 档下，\n      metric incomparability 被 properly caveated 后不构成 fatal objection，\n      因为 OpenVLA 的 within-metric comparison 已足够作为 fair evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient\"\n    plan_id: \"three_tier_gradient\"\n    description: \"VLM base → OXE-pretrained VLA → task-finetuned VLA 的三层级 routing 梯度验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      tier1_vlm_base:\n        r2_exit_collapse: \"None (0/2)\"\n        cf_sensitivity: \"cos < 0.2 (TracVLA/NORA untrained)\"\n        l1_heads: \"base-model-dependent (Phi-3: 32/32, Qwen: 13/16)\"\n      tier2_oxe_pretrained:\n        r2_exit_collapse: \"None (0/4 OpenVLA cells < 0.10)\"\n        cf_sensitivity: \"d=1.048 (strong, same metric comparison)\"\n        l1_heads: \"25/32 (OpenVLA untrained)\"\n      tier3_task_finetuned:\n        r2_exit_collapse: \"6/6 VLM→VLA cells > 0.10\"\n        cf_sensitivity: \"d ≥ 1.17 (TracVLA/NORA trained)\"\n        l1_heads: \"architecture-dependent (22-30/32)\"\n      routing_progression: \"No routing → General routing (OXE) → Task-specific routing (LIBERO)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      三层级梯度是论文的 narrative spine。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这一 staged \n      emergence story：(1) VLM base（Phi-3-Vision, Qwen2.5-VL）无 action training，\n      无 exit collapse，CF sensitivity 极低（cos<0.2），L1 heads 完全来自语言预训练；\n      (2) OXE-pretrained VLA（openvla-7b, 970K episodes）已有强 L1 routing（25/32 heads），\n      强 CF（d=1.048），但无 exit collapse——说明 OXE training 创建了 routing \n      但尚未触发 exit-layer reorganization；\n      (3) Task-finetuned VLA（TracVLA/NORA）在 VLM→VLA 转换时触发 exit collapse，\n      CF sensitivity 进一步增强，h13/h22 mixed heads emerge (TracVLA)。\n      关键区分：L1 head count 是 base-model-dependent（Phi-3 的 instruction tuning \n      已创建 32/32 heads，训练反而减少到 27-30/32），而 R² collapse 和 CF sensitivity \n      是 training-induced。这一 honest distinction 在 best 档下被视为 \n      methodological sophistication，而非 weakness。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient\"\n        columns: [\"Tier\", \"Example\", \"R² Collapse\", \"CF Sensitivity\", \"L1 Heads\", \"Routing\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Tier 1: VLM base\", \"Phi-3-Vision\", \"None\", \"cos<0.2\", \"32/32 (pretrained)\", \"Language-only\"]\n          - [\"Tier 1: VLM base\", \"Qwen2.5-VL\", \"None\", \"cos=0.081\", \"13/16 (pretrained)\", \"Language-only\"]\n          - [\"Tier 2: OXE VLA\", \"openvla-7b\", \"None (Δ<0.10)\", \"d=1.048\", \"25/32\", \"General action\"]\n          - [\"Tier 3: Task VLA\", \"TracVLA-Goal\", \"Δ=0.228\", \"d=1.524\", \"27/32\", \"Task-specific\"]\n          - [\"Tier 3: Task VLA\", \"NORA-Goal\", \"Δ=0.691\", \"cos=1.0*\", \"13/16\", \"Task-specific\"]\n          - [\"Control: NLP\", \"Llama-2-chat\", \"ΔR²=0.000\", \"N/A\", \"N/A\", \"None (language only)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Schematic: three tiers as pipeline stages, each tier annotated with R² collapse status, CF magnitude, and L1 head count\"\n    analysis: >\n      三层级梯度将 exit collapse、CF sensitivity、L1 heads 统一在一个 developmental narrative 中。\n      在 best 档下，这是论文从 \"observation collection\" 升级到 \"mechanistic story\" 的关键。\n\n  - name: \"NLP Finetuning Control\"\n    plan_id: \"nlp_control\"\n    description: \"Llama-2-7b-chat（SFT+RLHF）+ Phi-3-mini-instruct + Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct 的 R² profile，排除 generic finetuning artifact\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama2_chat:\n        mean_r2: 0.1553\n        r2_range: [0.1547, 0.1555]\n        delta_r2: 0.000\n        profile: \"flat constant across all 32 layers\"\n      phi3_instruct:\n        mean_r2: 0.1555\n        r2_range: [0.1552, 0.1555]\n        delta_r2: 0.000\n      qwen25_instruct:\n        mean_r2: 0.1554\n        r2_range: [0.1550, 0.1555]\n        delta_r2: 0.000\n      interpretation: \"R² ≈ 0.155 is noise floor; NLP finetuning creates zero layer-differentiated action representation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      三个 NLP-finetuned models 在所有层 R²≈0.155（noise floor，仅拟合 between-task variance），\n      ΔR²=0.000。对比同 backbone 的 VLM→VLA 转换：TracVLA Δ=0.156-0.294，NORA Δ=0.302-0.691。\n      在 best 档下（A6 假设），reviewers 接受这是 strong evidence 排除 \"exit collapse \n      is a generic fine-tuning artifact\"。逻辑链：(1) 同 backbone（Llama-2-7B）+ \n      不同 finetuning（NLP chat vs VLA action）= 只有 VLA 产生 exit collapse；\n      (2) 不同 backbone（Llama-2, Phi-3, Qwen2.5）+ 同 finetuning 类型（NLP instruction tuning）\n      = 三个都没有 exit collapse。这双重排除了 backbone-specific 和 finetuning-generic 两种 \n      alternative explanations。R²=0.155 的物理含义是 ridge regression 只从 between-task \n      variance（10 classes → ~10% base + inter-task feature differences）中拟合，\n      无 layer-specific action information。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"NLP Finetuning Control: R² Exit Collapse Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Backbone\", \"Finetuning\", \"Peak R²\", \"Exit R²\", \"ΔR²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Llama-2-7b-chat\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"SFT+RLHF (NLP)\", \"0.1555\", \"0.1555\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"Phi-3-mini-instruct\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Instruction tuning (NLP)\", \"0.1555\", \"0.1555\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\", \"Qwen2.5-3B\", \"Instruction tuning (NLP)\", \"0.1555\", \"0.1555\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (trained)\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"VLA (VLM→VLA)\", \"0.839\", \"0.574\", \"0.265*\"]\n          - [\"NORA (trained)\", \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\", \"VLA (VLM→VLA)\", \"0.697\", \"-0.004\", \"0.701*\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA (trained)\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"VLA (VLA→VLA)\", \"0.869\", \"0.853\", \"0.016\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-layer R² plot: three NLP controls as flat lines at 0.155, overlaid with VLA trained curves showing inverted-U + exit collapse\"\n    analysis: >\n      NLP control 是论文的 specificity killshot。在 best 档下，\n      这一三 backbone 一致的 null result 让 \"generic finetuning\" \n      和 \"backbone-specific\" 两种 alternative explanations 同时被排除。\n\n  - name: \"L1 Instruction-Dominant Head Analysis (Cross-Architecture)\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_arch_l1_heads\"\n    description: \"三架构 × 多 suite 的 L1 attention head 分析，区分 training-induced vs base-model-dependent\"\n    expected_results:\n      openvla:\n        trained_goal: 23\n        untrained_goal: 26\n        trained_object: 24\n        untrained_object: 24\n        interpretation: \"OXE pretraining 已创建 routing; finetuning 减少 heads (→mixed)\"\n      tracvla:\n        trained_range: [27, 30]\n        untrained_all: 32\n        interpretation: \"Phi-3-Vision 32/32; training 减少到 27-30 (repurpose)\"\n      nora:\n        trained_goal: 13\n        untrained_goal: 13\n        trained_spatial: 12\n        untrained_spatial: 14\n        interpretation: \"Qwen2.5-VL 预训练已 13/16\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      L1 head count 的跨架构比较清楚地表明这是 base-model-dependent 而非 training-induced：\n      TracVLA untrained（纯 Phi-3-Vision）已 32/32 instruction-dominant，训练反而减少到 27-30/32；\n      NORA trained ≈ untrained（13/16 vs 13-14/16）；OpenVLA untrained（OXE pretrained）\n      已 25-26/32。在 best 档下（A5 假设），reviewers 将 \"what training creates vs \n      what it inherits\" 的区分视为 honest science——论文不 overclaim L1 heads 是训练效果，\n      而是准确归因为 base model 的语言预训练 attention pattern。\n      这种 intellectual honesty 提升而非降低论文的可信度。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads: Training vs Inheritance\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Backbone\", \"Suite\", \"Trained\", \"Untrained\", \"Δ\", \"Source\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Goal\", \"23/32\", \"26/32 (OXE)\", \"-3\", \"Base+OXE\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Object\", \"24/32\", \"24/32 (OXE)\", \"0\", \"Base+OXE\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Goal\", \"27/32\", \"32/32 (VLM)\", \"-5\", \"Base VLM\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Object\", \"30/32\", \"32/32 (VLM)\", \"-2\", \"Base VLM\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Qwen2.5-VL\", \"Goal\", \"13/16\", \"13/16 (VLM)\", \"0\", \"Base VLM\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Qwen2.5-VL\", \"Spatial\", \"12/16\", \"14/16 (VLM)\", \"-2\", \"Base VLM\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar: trained vs untrained L1 heads per architecture, showing that untrained ≥ trained in most cases\"\n    analysis: >\n      Training 不增加 L1 heads——在多数情况下反而减少（repurpose some heads to mixed function）。\n      在 best 档下，这一 counter-intuitive finding 被视为 nuanced insight，\n      强化了论文区分 training effect 和 inherited property 的贡献。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Instruction Probe (Dense Layer Profile)\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_inst_probe\"\n    description: \"10-way instruction classification × 33 layers × 3 conditions（trained/untrained/Llama-2 base），验证 instruction routing 的逐层 dynamics\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.10\n        L1: 0.996\n        L2_to_L32: 1.000\n        pattern: \"immediate routing — L1 saturates\"\n      llama2base_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.10\n        L1: 0.802\n        L2: 0.987\n        L5_plus: 1.000\n        pattern: \"gradual buildup — saturates at L5\"\n      untrained_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.10\n        L1: 1.000\n        L8: 0.986\n        L16: 0.923\n        L24: 0.864\n        L31: 0.820\n        pattern: \"accidental routing + gradual forgetting\"\n      image_mean_all_conditions: 0.10\n      loocv_trained: \"100.00±0.00\"\n      loocv_untrained: \"96.64±7.07 → 84.76±11.59\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      三条件的 cross-instruction probe 揭示了三种定性不同的 routing 策略：\n      (1) Trained 在 L1 即达 99.6% → 全程 100%——VLA training 创建了 immediate dedicated routing，\n      instruction identity 在第一层就被提取并全程保持；\n      (2) Llama-2 base 从 L1=80.2% 逐渐升至 L5=100%——语言预训练创建了 gradual processing，\n      instruction 需要多层处理才能被 fully resolve，但一旦 resolve 就稳定保持；\n      (3) Untrained（random init）L1=100% 看似最好，但 L31=82%——\"偶然路由\"因 high-dim \n      random features 的 trivial separability 在 L1 成功，但 random weight 的 noise accumulation \n      导致 signal 逐层衰减。\n      Image_mean 在所有条件下都是 10%（chance），确认 causal mask 阻止了 image→instruction \n      information flow。在 best 档下，这一 three-way comparison 是 C2 的 definitive evidence，\n      展示了 VLA training 的 unique contribution（immediacy + stability）vs pretrained \n      language processing（gradual + stable）vs random baseline（accidental + decaying）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Instruction Classification: Three Routing Strategies\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"VLA Trained\", \"Llama-2 Base\", \"Untrained (Random)\", \"Image Mean (all)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0\", \"10%\", \"10%\", \"10%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L1\", \"99.6%\", \"80.2%\", \"100%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L2\", \"100%\", \"98.7%\", \"100%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L5\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"99.x%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L8\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"98.6%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L16\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"92.3%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L24\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"86.4%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L31\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"82.0%\", \"10%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-line plot: instruction classification accuracy across 33 layers. Trained=flat at 100%, Llama-2 base=rising to 100% by L5, Untrained=declining from 100% to 82%\"\n    analysis: >\n      三条件 probe profile 是论文最 visually compelling 的 figure 之一。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 一眼就能看到 three qualitatively different strategies，\n      这是 C2 claim \"VLA fine-tuning achieves immediate dedicated routing\" 的 direct evidence。\n\n  - name: \"L1 Attention Three-Condition Profile\"\n    plan_id: \"l1_attention_three_cond\"\n    description: \"L1 attention pattern 的 untrained/Llama-2 base/VLA trained 三条件对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      untrained:\n        text_attention: 0.117\n        image_attention: 0.878\n        instruction_dominant_heads: 0\n      llama2base:\n        text_attention: 0.365\n        image_attention: 0.617\n        instruction_dominant_heads: 9\n      trained:\n        text_attention: 0.577\n        image_attention: 0.213\n        instruction_dominant_heads: 24\n      per_token_normalized_ratio:\n        trained_instr_dom: 38.2\n        untrained: 1.5\n        training_amplification: 25.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      L1 attention 的三条件梯度（0→9→24 instruction-dominant heads, 12%→37%→58% text attention）\n      是 C2 的 mechanistic evidence。Per-token normalization（考虑 ~11.5x image/text \n      token count asymmetry）后，trained instruction-dominant heads 的 text/image ratio \n      达 38.2x（vs untrained 1.5x），说明 training 创建了 extreme instruction specialization。\n      在 best 档下，这一 gradient 与 cross-instruction probe 的 three strategies \n      在 mechanistic level 对应：(1) untrained 0 heads → 无 instruction processing capacity；\n      (2) Llama-2 base 9 heads → 中等语言处理能力（mid-layer inverted-U）；\n      (3) VLA trained 24 heads → immediate instruction capture（L1 saturated probe）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"L1 Attention Pattern: Three-Condition Gradient\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Untrained\", \"Llama-2 Base\", \"VLA Trained\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Attention to text/instruction\", \"11.7%\", \"36.5%\", \"57.7%\"]\n          - [\"Attention to image\", \"87.8%\", \"61.7%\", \"21.3%\"]\n          - [\"Instruction-dominant heads (>50%)\", \"0/32\", \"9/32\", \"24/32\"]\n          - [\"Per-token text/image ratio\", \"1.5x\", \"—\", \"38.2x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar or pie charts: attention distribution at L1 for three conditions\"\n    analysis: >\n      0→9→24 gradient 是 C2 headline finding 的 most concise summary。\n      在 best 档下，per-token normalization 排除了 token-count confound，\n      strengthening the claim that training creates genuine instruction specialization。\n\n  - name: \"32-Layer Dense Attention Profile\"\n    plan_id: \"dense_attention_profile\"\n    description: \"全 32 层 × 三条件的 instruction-dominant head count profile\"\n    expected_results:\n      untrained_pattern: \"0 heads at all 32 layers — no language processing capacity\"\n      llama2base_pattern: \"Inverted-U — L0-L4 low (0-10) → L9-L16 peak (15-22) → L31 decline (8)\"\n      trained_pattern: \"Bookend — L0-L1 peak (21-24) → L2-L30 valley (0-11) → L31 re-engagement (18)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Dense 32-layer profile 是 C2 的 strongest mechanistic evidence：\n      VLA training 将 instruction attention 从 Llama-2 base 的 mid-layer processing \n      模式（inverted-U, peak L9-L16）reorganize 到 bookend 模式（entry L0-L1 + exit L31）。\n      这一 temporal reorganization 与 cross-instruction probe 在 functional level 一致：\n      trained model 在 entry 层 capture instruction（L1=99.6%）并在 exit 层 re-engage \n      for action conditioning（L31 18 heads）。\n      在 best 档下，bookend pattern 被解读为 efficient routing architecture：\n      entry 层 extract instruction identity，mid-layers 用于 vision-dominated computation，\n      exit 层 re-inject instruction signal for action generation。\n      Llama-2 base 的 inverted-U 是经典 LM pattern（mid-layer deep semantic processing），\n      VLA training 保留了总体 attention capacity 但 redistribute 了 temporal allocation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Dense Attention Profile: Representative Layers\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"Untrained\", \"Llama-2 Base\", \"VLA Trained\", \"Trained Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0\", \"0\", \"2\", \"21\", \"Entry peak\"]\n          - [\"L1\", \"0\", \"4\", \"24\", \"Entry peak\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"0\", \"8\", \"5\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L9\", \"0\", \"18\", \"3\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L12\", \"0\", \"22\", \"1\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L16\", \"0\", \"20\", \"4\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L24\", \"0\", \"12\", \"7\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L31\", \"0\", \"8\", \"18\", \"Exit re-engagement\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-panel line plot: instruction-dominant head count across 32 layers for each condition. Bookend vs inverted-U vs flat-zero patterns clearly distinguishable.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mid-layer inverted-U → bookend reorganization 是论文的 narrative centerpiece。\n      在 best 档下，这一 visualization 是 Figure 1 或 Figure 2 的核心 panel，\n      让 reviewers 直观理解 VLA training 的 routing reorganization。\n\n  - name: \"Counterfactual Action Trajectory Analysis (OpenVLA)\"\n    plan_id: \"cf_trajectory_analysis\"\n    description: \"L1 head ablation 对 action output 的影响：Cohen's d, MSE, token divergence, GT error\"\n    expected_results:\n      head_ablation_top24:\n        cohens_d: 0.651\n        trajectory_d: 2.943\n        paired_mse: 0.042\n        token_divergence: 0.723\n        delta_gt_mse: -0.001\n      specificity_ratio: 1.08\n      gt_error_delta: \"ΔMSE ≈ 0 (p=0.519)\"\n      token_overlap_spearman: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Ablating 24 instruction-dominant heads 在 L1 产生 d=0.651 的 action shift，\n      trajectory level d=2.943（~4.5x inflation due to within-trajectory correlation）。\n      关键 finding：ΔMSE_vs_GT ≈ 0（p=0.519），说明 ablation redirects action outputs \n      without degrading accuracy。在 best 档下，这一 information-computation dissociation \n      被解读为 instruction heads 控制 action direction（哪个 action space region）\n      而非 action quality（与 ground truth 的距离）。\n      Specificity ratio 1.08x（instruction 24 heads vs random 24 heads）modest，\n      但 per-head analysis 显示 control heads 有 ~1.9x per-head effect，\n      instruction heads 通过 24-head collective coordination 产生更大 total effect。\n      Token overlap Spearman ρ=1.0 确认 CF sensitivity 与 lexical/positional novelty \n      而非 semantic distance 相关——这是 honest caveat，论文不 overclaim semantic processing。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Counterfactual Action Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Instruction 24h Ablation\", \"Control 8h Ablation\", \"Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Cohen's d (token)\", \"0.651\", \"0.410\", \"1.59\"]\n          - [\"Trajectory d\", \"2.943\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Paired MSE\", \"0.042\", \"0.020\", \"2.07\"]\n          - [\"Token divergence\", \"0.723\", \"0.293\", \"2.47\"]\n          - [\"KL divergence\", \"5.079\", \"1.690\", \"3.00\"]\n          - [\"GT MSE delta\", \"-0.001 (n.s.)\", \"+0.008 (n.s.)\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Per-head d\", \"0.027\", \"0.051\", \"0.53\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual panel: (A) token-level d comparison instruction vs control, (B) GT MSE showing no degradation\"\n    analysis: >\n      ΔMSE≈0 是 C2 的关键 evidence for information-computation dissociation。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 \"open-loop functional sensitivity\" framing——\n      instruction heads modulate output direction without systematic quality change。\n\n  - name: \"Training Trajectory (4-condition)\"\n    plan_id: \"training_trajectory\"\n    description: \"untrained → llama2base → bridge-vla → libero-finetuned 的 L1 attention 和 probe 演化轨迹\"\n    expected_results:\n      l1_heads_progression:\n        untrained: 0\n        llama2base: 9\n        bridge_vla: 24\n        libero_finetuned: 22\n      l31_exit_engagement:\n        bridge_vla: 18\n        libero_finetuned: 0\n      probe_accuracy_L31:\n        bridge_vla: 1.0\n        libero_finetuned: 1.0\n      attention_representation_dissociation: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      4-condition trajectory 展示 routing 的 developmental history：\n      (1) Entry routing 在 OXE pretraining 时 emerge（0→24 heads），task finetuning \n      略减（24→22）但基本稳定；\n      (2) Exit engagement L31 从 bridge-vla 的 18 heads 到 libero-finetuned 的 0 heads——\n      entry-exit bookend → entry-only sharpening；\n      (3) Probe accuracy 在 L31 保持 100%（两个条件都是），确认 attention-representation \n      dissociation：exit attention 消失但 representational capacity 不变。\n      在 best 档下，这一 dissociation 被视为 refinement 而非 contradiction——\n      LIBERO finetuning sharpens routing to entry-only while maintaining representational \n      capacity at exit through residual stream。\n\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Training Trajectory: 4-Condition L1 Evolution\"\n        columns: [\"Stage\", \"L1 Heads\", \"L31 Heads\", \"L31 Probe Acc\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Random init\", \"0/32\", \"0/32\", \"82%\", \"No routing\"]\n          - [\"Llama-2 base\", \"9/32\", \"8/32\", \"100%\", \"Language processing\"]\n          - [\"OXE-pretrained (bridge)\", \"24/32\", \"18/32\", \"100%\", \"Bookend routing\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-finetuned\", \"22/32\", \"0/32\", \"100%\", \"Entry-only sharpening\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Developmental timeline: L1 and L31 head counts across four training stages\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attention-representation dissociation at L31 是 subtle but important finding。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这是 training 的 efficiency optimization：\n      从 bookend 到 entry-only，因为 residual stream 已足够 maintain information。\n\n  - name: \"TracVLA Universal Mixed Heads (h13, h22)\"\n    plan_id: \"tracvla_mixed_heads\"\n    description: \"TracVLA 中 h13 和 h22 在全部 4 suites 的 trained 模型中一致作为 mixed head 出现\"\n    expected_results:\n      h13_status_all_suites: \"mixed (non-instruction-dominant, non-image-dominant)\"\n      h22_status_all_suites: \"mixed\"\n      untrained_mixed_heads: \"none (32/32 instruction-dominant)\"\n      consistency: \"4/4 suites\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      h13 和 h22 在 TracVLA 的全部 4 个 LIBERO suite 中一致从 instruction-dominant \n      变为 mixed，而 untrained（Phi-3-Vision）无此 pattern（32/32 全 instruction-dominant）。\n      在 best 档下，这被解读为 training 创建了 functionally specialized mixed-modality heads——\n      这些 heads 可能负责 cross-modal integration（同时处理 image 和 instruction information），\n      而非单一 modality 的 routing。跨 suite 一致性排除了 task-specific artifact。\n      论文不 overclaim 具体功能（\"may perform cross-modal integration\"），\n      这种 measured language 在 best 档下被视为 appropriate caution。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"TracVLA Mixed Heads Across Suites\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Trained Instr-Dom\", \"Trained Mixed\", \"Untrained Instr-Dom\", \"h13 Status\", \"h22 Status\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Goal\", \"27/32\", \"5\", \"32/32\", \"mixed\", \"mixed\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"30/32\", \"2\", \"32/32\", \"mixed\", \"mixed\"]\n          - [\"Object\", \"30/32\", \"2\", \"32/32\", \"mixed\", \"mixed\"]\n          - [\"Long\", \"30/32\", \"2\", \"32/32\", \"mixed\", \"mixed\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Head-level attention heatmap: 32 heads × 4 suites, h13 and h22 highlighted as consistently mixed\"\n    analysis: >\n      Universal mixed heads 是 TracVLA-specific observation，补充 C2 的 cross-architecture narrative。\n      在 best 档下，这是 interesting finding 但不是 core claim 的依赖项。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7586,"cache_read_input_tokens":67146,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7586},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ed7c8a67-c6c1-41f1-9dd1-3c36c2bc23db","uuid":"8c8b49f8-177b-4826-a279-2d65e7f5dd55"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":463714,"duration_api_ms":466738,"num_turns":4,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  原始 framing 完全成立。论文叙事以跨架构 routing 一致性为核心：C2 三层级路由梯度（VLM→OXE-VLA→task-VLA）作为 headline finding，\n  R² exit collapse 的 VLM→VLA 二元分离（6/6 vs 0/4）作为 mechanistic insight，NLP finetuning control（ΔR²=0.000）\n  作为 specificity evidence。C1 框架的跨架构可复用性被独立 valued。C3 作为 RSA-qualified observation 不受挑战。\n  Reviewers 在 best 档接受：(1) 3架构×4suite 矩阵为充分覆盖，(2) Δ>0.10 阈值非 arbitrary，\n  (3) CF metric incomparability 被 properly caveated 后不成为 dealbreaker，(4) 无 closed-loop 验证不 fatal，\n  (5) L1 head count base-model-dependent 解读被视为 honest science。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: \"提取 frozen SigLIP+projector 的 4096d 输出，计算 RSA 对齐度，与 VLA 各层和 standalone DINO 对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      siglip_projector_rsa: 0.615\n      bootstrap_95_ci: [0.526, 0.695]\n      trained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.488\n      untrained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.485\n      dino_rsa: 0.388\n      llm_degradation_delta: -0.127\n    result_rationale: >\n      在 best 档下，SigLIP+projector RSA=0.615 远高于 VLA 任何层（~0.49）和 DINO（0.388），\n      reviewers 接受这一证据说明 action-relevant geometric structure 的主要来源是 frozen vision encoder。\n      LLM 降解 0.127 的 gap 被解读为 LLM 在保持 action structure 的同时重分配信息用于 instruction routing——\n      这不是损失而是 functional trade-off。reviewer 不会要求 unfrozen encoder 对照实验，\n      因为 frozen encoder 是三种 VLA 架构的共同设计选择，实验覆盖了实际部署的设计空间。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Action-Aligned Geometry: Source Localization\"\n        columns: [\"Representation\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"95% CI\", \"vs DINO Δ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SigLIP+Projector (4096d)\", \"0.615\", \"[0.526, 0.695]\", \"+0.227\"]\n          - [\"VLA Trained peak (L9)\", \"0.488\", \"[0.41, 0.56]\", \"+0.100\"]\n          - [\"VLA Untrained peak (L12)\", \"0.485\", \"[0.40, 0.56]\", \"+0.097\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2 cls_token\", \"0.388\", \"[0.30, 0.47]\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: four representations ordered by RSA magnitude, with 95% CI error bars. SigLIP+Proj visually dominant.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Vision encoder 提供 RSA=0.615 的 action-relevant structure，LLM 层将其降至 ~0.49。\n      四条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）在 0.48-0.49 band 内收敛，说明\n      LLM 降解幅度与训练状态和 instruction 存在与否无关。在 best 档下，这一结果为 C1 框架\n      提供了定量基础：framework 正确识别了 vision encoder 作为 action geometry 的 source。\n\n  - name: \"DINOv2 Baseline RSA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: \"提取 standalone DINOv2 ViT-L/14 cls_token 和 patch_mean，作为 non-VL vision model 基准\"\n    expected_results:\n      dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n      dino_patch_mean_rsa: 0.631\n      dino_action_probe_R2: 0.687\n      temporal_rho_per_task_mean: 0.901\n      subtask_macro_auc: 0.972\n      control_b_permutation_rho: 0.039\n    result_rationale: >\n      DINOv2 cls_token RSA=0.692 是所有 standalone encoder 中最高的（under RSA metric），\n      这为 C3 observation 提供基础——DINOv2 的 self-supervised 预训练产生了最高的 geometric \n      alignment。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 \"under RSA\" qualifier，不要求 CKA 一致性，\n      因为 RSA 和 CKA 捕捉不同 representational property 的观点被视为 metric-aware honest reporting。\n      DINOv2 action probe R²=0.687 作为 functional baseline 确认 cls_token 的 action-decodability。\n      label permutation control ρ=0.039 ≈ 0 排除了 probe overfitting。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"DINOv2 Standalone Baselines\"\n        columns: [\"Feature\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Action R²\", \"Temporal ρ\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DINOv2 cls_token\", \"0.692\", \"0.687\", \"0.901\"]\n          - [\"DINOv2 patch_mean\", \"0.631\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Label-permuted control\", \"—\", \"-0.052\", \"0.039\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"DINOv2 作为 RSA ordering 的 anchor point 出现在 cross-encoder comparison table 中\"\n    analysis: >\n      DINOv2 RSA=0.692 > SigLIP+Proj=0.615 > VLA layers ~0.49 > CLIP=0.557。\n      在 best 档下，DINOv2 在 RSA 下的最高排名被 properly qualified，\n      不会被 reviewer 攻击为 overclaimed。\n\n  - name: \"Per-layer RSA Curve\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: \"33 层 × 4 条件（trained/untrained × with/without inst）的 RSA 逐层曲线\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_image_mean:\n        peak_layer: 12\n        peak_rsa: 0.628\n        L0_rsa: 0.612\n        L32_rsa: 0.422\n        pattern: \"inverted-U\"\n      untrained_image_mean:\n        peak_layer: 0\n        peak_rsa: 0.612\n        L32_rsa: 0.545\n        pattern: \"monotonic_decay\"\n      projector_to_L1_drop: 0.204\n      training_shifts_peak: \"L0 → L12\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Trained image_mean 展现 inverted-U（L0=0.612→L12=0.628 peak→L32=0.422），\n      而 untrained 单调衰减（L0=0.612→L32=0.545）。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受：\n      (1) training 将 RSA peak 从 L0 移到 L12——对应 mid-layer processing 的 VLM 预训练模式；\n      (2) exit 层的 RSA 陡降（trained L32=0.422 vs untrained L32=0.545）与 R² exit collapse \n      在 direction 上一致；(3) Proj→L1 是最大 drop（~0.20），因为 token mixing 在第一个 \n      transformer layer 就开始了。这一 per-layer profile 为 C2 的 bookend attention pattern \n      提供 representational 维度的补充证据。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Per-layer RSA Profile (image_mean, with instruction)\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"Trained RSA\", \"Untrained RSA\", \"Δ(T-U)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Projector\", \"0.615\", \"0.615\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"L0\", \"0.612\", \"0.612\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"0.472\", \"0.470\", \"+0.002\"]\n          - [\"L8\", \"0.512\", \"0.478\", \"+0.034\"]\n          - [\"L12\", \"0.628\", \"0.476\", \"+0.152\"]\n          - [\"L16\", \"0.523\", \"0.470\", \"+0.053\"]\n          - [\"L24\", \"0.476\", \"0.460\", \"+0.016\"]\n          - [\"L32\", \"0.422\", \"0.545\", \"-0.123\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: 33-layer RSA curve, four conditions overlaid. Trained image_mean inverted-U clearly visible, untrained monotonic decay.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Trained model 在 mid-layers (L8-L16) 维持甚至略增 RSA，然后在 exit layers 急剧下降。\n      Untrained 从 L0 开始就单调衰减。Training 的效果是在 mid-layers \n      暂时 preserve/enhance action geometry（与 LLM 预训练的 mid-layer processing 模式一致），\n      然后在 exit layers 选择性丢弃——这正是 R² exit collapse 在 RSA 维度的体现。\n\n  - name: \"Output Head Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: \"比较 trained 和 untrained 的权重变化分布，验证 vision encoder 和 projector frozen\"\n    expected_results:\n      vision_backbone:\n        count: 685\n        mean_rel_change: 0.0\n        cos_sim: 1.0\n        verdict: \"IDENTICAL\"\n      projector:\n        count: 6\n        mean_rel_change: 0.0\n        cos_sim: 1.001\n        verdict: \"IDENTICAL\"\n      llm_layers:\n        count: 288\n        mean_rel_change: 1.316\n        std: 0.376\n        cos_sim: 0.218\n        range: [1.22, 1.37]\n      head_vs_llm_ratio: 1.12\n    result_rationale: >\n      Vision backbone 和 projector 在 trained/untrained 间完全相同（cos_sim=1.0），\n      这是 OpenVLA 架构设计的必然——frozen encoder 不接收梯度。LLM 32层的 rel_change \n      均匀分布（1.22-1.37），说明训练影响分散在全部 LLM 层而非集中在 output head 或特定层。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 将此解读为：frozen encoder 是三种架构的共同 design pattern，\n      四条件 RSA 收敛（0.48-0.49）正是因为 encoder output 在所有条件下相同。\n      head_vs_llm_ratio=1.12 < 3x threshold 说明 LLM head 不特殊——\n      action mapping 不是 shallow adaptation 而是分布式计算。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Weight Change Distribution by Component\"\n        columns: [\"Component\", \"# Params\", \"Mean rel_change\", \"cos_sim\", \"Verdict\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Vision Backbone\", \"685\", \"0.000\", \"1.000\", \"IDENTICAL\"]\n          - [\"Projector\", \"6\", \"0.000\", \"1.001\", \"IDENTICAL\"]\n          - [\"LLM (32 layers)\", \"288\", \"1.316\", \"0.218\", \"DISTRIBUTED\"]\n          - [\"LM Head\", \"1\", \"1.475\", \"0.000\", \"CHANGED\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: per-component rel_change distribution showing vision/projector at 0 and LLM layers uniform ~1.3\"\n    analysis: >\n      Frozen encoder 确认为 C1 framework 的物理基础。LLM 权重变化均匀分布为 C2 \n      的分布式 routing 机制提供 weight-space 证据：training 不是局部改写几层，\n      而是全局 reorganize attention pattern。\n\n  - name: \"6 Probing Methods × 2 Benchmarks\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: \"temporal distance ρ, action R², delta R², RSA, CKA, classification 六种方法在 LIBERO-Goal 和 LIBERO-Long 上交叉验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      consistency_verdict: \"All 6 methods: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\"\n      temporal_rho:\n        trained_best: 0.955\n        untrained_best: 0.933\n        delta: 0.022\n      action_R2:\n        trained_best: 0.683\n        untrained_best: 0.616\n        dino: 0.676\n      delta_R2:\n        trained_best: 0.059\n        untrained_best: 0.049\n        dino: 0.060\n      rsa:\n        trained_peak: 0.488\n        untrained_peak: 0.485\n        dino: 0.388\n    result_rationale: >\n      六种方法一致显示 VLA representations（无论训练与否）远优于 standalone DINO，\n      但 trained 和 untrained 间差异小（特别是 RSA 维度 Δ=0.003）。这在 best 档下\n      被解读为 frozen encoder 贡献的 strong confirmation：vision encoder 决定了\n      representational quality 的 baseline，LLM training 的贡献在 geometry（RSA/CKA）\n      维度小但在 routing（attention/probe）维度显著。方法一致性本身被 reviewers 视为\n      framework robustness 的证据——C1 的多方法设计不是 p-hacking 而是 convergent validation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Six-Method Consistency Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Trained\", \"Untrained\", \"DINO\", \"T≈U?\", \"T>>D?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Temporal ρ\", \"0.955\", \"0.933\", \"0.901\", \"Yes (Δ=0.02)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Action R²\", \"0.683\", \"0.616\", \"0.676\", \"Marginal\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Delta R²\", \"0.059\", \"0.049\", \"0.060\", \"Yes\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"RSA (ρ)\", \"0.488\", \"0.485\", \"0.388\", \"Yes (Δ=0.003)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"CKA\", \"0.083\", \"0.089\", \"0.066\", \"Yes\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Classification\", \"1.000\", \"1.000\", \"0.863\", \"Yes\", \"Yes\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart or grouped bar: six methods × three conditions, visualizing the consistency pattern\"\n    analysis: >\n      六方法 convergence 是 C1 framework 的核心贡献之一。在 best 档下，\n      这种多维验证被视为 methodological rigor 的标志。Trained ≈ untrained \n      在 image_mean RSA 维度成立，为 C3 observation 提供支撑。\n\n  - name: \"Instruction Ablation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: \"移除 instruction text（替换为空字符串），测试 RSA 是否下降\"\n    expected_results:\n      with_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.485\n      no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.480\n      delta: 0.004\n      gate_threshold: 0.10\n      gate_judgment: \"FAIL — Δ=0.004 << 0.10\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      移除 instruction 后 RSA 仅下降 0.004（远小于 0.10 阈值），说明 image_mean \n      位置的 action-aligned geometry 是 vision-driven 而非 instruction-driven。\n      这在 best 档下与 C1 的 causal mask 论证完美一致：image tokens 在序列中\n      先于 instruction tokens，causal mask 阻止了 information flow，\n      所以移除 instruction 对 image tokens 的表征没有影响。\n      Reviewers 接受这是 C1 framework 的 expected confirmation 而非 trivial finding——\n      因为 residual stream 理论上可以 leak information，实验验证了 no leakage。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Instruction Ablation (Untrained, image_mean)\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Δ vs with-inst\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"With instruction\", \"0.485\", \"L12\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"No instruction (empty)\", \"0.480\", \"L6\", \"-0.004\"]\n          - [\"Gate threshold\", \"—\", \"—\", \"0.10\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-layer RSA curve overlay: with vs without instruction, nearly indistinguishable\"\n    analysis: >\n      Instruction 对 image_mean RSA 的影响可忽略。结合 plan_008 的 instruction content \n      不变性，形成三重不变性：training + instruction presence + instruction content \n      均不影响 image_mean RSA。这精确界定了 C1 framework 中 \"image tokens 不参与 \n      instruction routing\" 的结论边界。\n\n  - name: \"2×2 Matrix (Training × Instruction)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: \"四条件完整矩阵：trained/untrained × with/without instruction\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_with_inst: 0.488\n      trained_no_inst: 0.489\n      untrained_with_inst: 0.485\n      untrained_no_inst: 0.480\n      dino_baseline: 0.388\n      training_effect_with_inst: 0.003\n      training_effect_no_inst: 0.009\n      instruction_effect_trained: -0.001\n      instruction_effect_untrained: 0.004\n      bootstrap_delta_ci: \"[-0.058, 0.072]\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      四条件收敛在 0.48-0.49 band 内，Bootstrap CI 包含 0，确认 training 和 \n      instruction 均非 image_mean RSA 的显著影响因素。在 best 档下，这一 2×2 \n      factorial design 被 reviewers 视为 rigorous experimental methodology——\n      不是仅比较 trained vs untrained，而是完整析因设计控制了交互效应。\n      训练效应（Δ=0.003-0.009）和 instruction 效应（Δ=-0.001 到 0.004）\n      均在 noise level，而所有四条件都远高于 DINO（+0.09-0.10），\n      说明 VLA 架构本身（而非训练或 instruction）提供了 action-relevant structure。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"2×2 Factorial RSA Matrix\"\n        columns: [\"\", \"With Instruction\", \"No Instruction\", \"Instruction Effect\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"0.488\", \"0.489\", \"-0.001\"]\n          - [\"Untrained\", \"0.485\", \"0.480\", \"+0.004\"]\n          - [\"Training Effect\", \"+0.003\", \"+0.009\", \"\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 heatmap with RSA values, color-coded to show convergence in 0.48-0.49 band\"\n    analysis: >\n      Bootstrap CI=[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0。在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework \n      最强的 quantitative evidence 之一：vision encoder geometry 对 training 和 \n      instruction 双重不变。\n\n  - name: \"Random Instruction Control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: \"用 random tokens、word-shuffled、empty string 替代真实 instruction，验证 instruction content 不影响 RSA\"\n    expected_results:\n      normal_peak_rsa: 0.489\n      random_peak_rsa: 0.484\n      shuffled_peak_rsa: 0.483\n      empty_peak_rsa: 0.472\n      max_absolute_delta: 0.017\n      instruction_invariant: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      四种 instruction 条件（normal/random/shuffled/empty）在 ±0.017 内收敛，\n      确认 instruction content 对 image_mean RSA 无影响。Empty 最低（0.472）\n      可能反映 shorter sequence 的 minor 位置效应，但 Δ=0.017 远小于 meaningful threshold。\n      在 best 档下，这一 three-way instruction invariance（presence + content + semantic）\n      被视为排除了 \"trivial separability\" 攻击面——即使 random tokens 也不改变 geometry，\n      说明 image representation 确实 decouple from language processing。\n      Reviewers 认为这是 thorough ablation 的标志。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Instruction Content Ablation\"\n        columns: [\"Instruction Type\", \"Peak RSA\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Δ vs Normal\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Normal (real task instruction)\", \"0.489\", \"L16\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Random tokens\", \"0.484\", \"L16\", \"-0.005\"]\n          - [\"Word-shuffled\", \"0.483\", \"L16\", \"-0.006\"]\n          - [\"Empty string\", \"0.472\", \"L16\", \"-0.017\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Four overlapping per-layer RSA curves, visually indistinguishable within CI\"\n    analysis: >\n      三重不变性完备：training invariance (plan_007) + instruction presence \n      invariance (plan_006) + instruction content invariance (plan_008)。\n      在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework 的 definitive validation。\n\n  - name: \"CKA Verification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: \"用 CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，检验 metric robustness\"\n    expected_results:\n      linear_cka:\n        untrained_img_mean_L23: 0.089\n        trained_img_mean_L23: 0.083\n        projector: 0.081\n        dino: 0.066\n        trained_last_preaction_L32: 0.127\n      rdm_cka:\n        trained_img_mean_L23: 0.260\n        projector: 0.257\n        untrained_img_mean_L23: 0.246\n        dino: 0.241\n      ordering_reversal: \"CKA: untrained > trained > projector > DINO (vs RSA: projector > trained ≈ untrained > DINO)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      CKA ordering 反转了 RSA ordering（CKA 中 untrained > trained，RSA 中相反；\n      CKA 中 projector 排名下降），但 DINO 在两种 metric 下都最低（robust finding）。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 RSA-CKA dissociation 作为 honest methodological finding \n      而非 weakness：RSA 捕捉 geometric alignment（action-distance correspondence），\n      CKA 捕捉 global structure（representational similarity invariant to rotation）。\n      LLM 处理降解了前者但保留了后者。last_preaction CKA=0.127 最高的事实与 C2 \n      的 instruction routing narrative 一致——instruction-conditioned token position \n      保留了最多的与 action structure 相关的全局结构。\n      C3 中 DINOv2 ranking 被限定为 \"under RSA\"，CKA 反转在正文中 acknowledge。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Rank\", \"RSA Ordering\", \"Linear CKA Ordering\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"1st\", \"SigLIP+Proj (0.615)\", \"last_preaction L32 (0.127)\"]\n          - [\"2nd\", \"Trained img_mean (0.488)\", \"Untrained img_mean (0.089)\"]\n          - [\"3rd\", \"Untrained img_mean (0.485)\", \"Trained img_mean (0.083)\"]\n          - [\"4th\", \"DINO (0.388)\", \"Projector (0.081)\"]\n          - [\"5th\", \"—\", \"DINO (0.066)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Side-by-side rank comparison showing RSA vs CKA ordering reversal\"\n    analysis: >\n      Metric dissociation 本身是 informative finding：LLM 在 preserving global structure \n      (CKA) 的同时 disrupting geometric alignment (RSA)。在 best 档下，\n      这一 honest reporting 被视为 methodological maturity 而非 conflicting evidence。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Spatial Benchmark Extension\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: \"第三个 LIBERO benchmark 交叉验证所有发现的 generalizability\"\n    expected_results:\n      rsa:\n        trained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 14, rsa: 0.691}\n        trained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 15, rsa: 0.695}\n        untrained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 0, rsa: 0.652}\n        untrained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 1, rsa: 0.666}\n      action_probe:\n        trained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 13, R2: 0.696}\n        trained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 21, R2: 0.675}\n        untrained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 0, R2: 0.673}\n        untrained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 1, R2: 0.635}\n      bootstrap_significance: \"p < 0.001 for all trained vs untrained comparisons\"\n      cross_benchmark_consistency: \"RSA peak Goal L12 vs Spatial L14-15; probe peak Goal L8-13 vs Spatial L13-21\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Spatial 复现了 LIBERO-Goal 的所有核心 pattern：(1) trained inverted-U RSA confirmed，\n      (2) untrained flat/declining，(3) trained > untrained in action probe 在所有层，\n      (4) peak layer 在 2-layer range 内一致。在 best 档下，cross-benchmark replication \n      被视为 strong evidence against task-specific overfitting。RSA peak 从 Goal L12 \n      移到 Spatial L14-15 的微小偏移被解读为 task-dependent modulation（不同空间推理需求\n      导致 slightly deeper processing），而非 inconsistency。p<0.001 的 bootstrap significance \n      排除了 random fluctuation。这一结果为 C1 framework 的跨任务适用性提供了 within-architecture \n      validation，补充 C2 的跨架构 validation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Benchmark Consistency (OpenVLA)\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"LIBERO-Goal\", \"LIBERO-Spatial\", \"Consistent?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"RSA peak (trained img_mean)\", \"L12 (0.628)\", \"L14 (0.691)\", \"Yes (±2L)\"]\n          - [\"R² peak (trained img_mean)\", \"L8 (0.655)\", \"L13 (0.696)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Untrained RSA peak\", \"L0 (0.612)\", \"L0 (0.652)\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"Training effect Δ (best-vs-best)\", \"+0.017\", \"+0.023\", \"Both sig.\"]\n          - [\"Untrained last_pre collapse\", \"L10-L13\", \"L5-L31\", \"Both collapse\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual-panel line plot: Goal vs Spatial per-layer RSA and R² profiles overlaid\"\n    analysis: >\n      跨 benchmark 一致性确认 OpenVLA 内部的 representational pattern 不是 task-specific。\n      这为后续跨架构验证（TracVLA, NORA）提供了 within-architecture baseline。\n\n  - name: \"Full-layer R² Scan\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: \"33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations = 132 MLP action probes，获取 R² per-layer curve\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 8, mean_R2: 0.655}\n      trained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 13, mean_R2: 0.678}\n      untrained_image_mean_peak: {layer: 0, mean_R2: 0.640}\n      untrained_last_preaction_peak: {layer: 32, mean_R2: 0.609}\n      projector_R2: 0.630\n      bootstrap_best_vs_best:\n        image_mean: {delta: 0.015, p: 0.006}\n        last_preaction: {delta: 0.069, p: 0.0001}\n      untrained_pathological_layers: \"L10-L13 R²≈0\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      R² per-layer curve 与 RSA inverted-U 一致，但揭示了 RSA 无法捕捉的关键差异：\n      (1) Trained last_preaction peak=0.678 > projector=0.630（p<0.001），说明 LLM \n      在 instruction-conditioned token 位置确实增强了 action-decodability——\n      这是 C2 routing 的 functional evidence；\n      (2) Untrained L10-L13 R²≈0（pathological collapse），说明 random LLM weights \n      在这些层创造了不可解码的表征——与 trained 的平滑 inverted-U 形成鲜明对比；\n      (3) last_preaction 的 best-vs-best Δ=0.069（p<0.0001）远大于 image_mean Δ=0.015，\n      确认 training effect 集中在 instruction-conditioned token position。\n      在 best 档下，这一 R²-RSA convergence 被视为 metric-robust validation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"R² Per-layer Peak Summary\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Token\", \"Peak Layer\", \"Peak R²\", \"Exit R²\", \"Δ(peak-exit)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Trained\", \"image_mean\", \"L8\", \"0.655\", \"0.422*\", \"0.233\"]\n          - [\"Trained\", \"last_preaction\", \"L13\", \"0.678\", \"0.609\", \"0.069\"]\n          - [\"Untrained\", \"image_mean\", \"L0\", \"0.640\", \"0.545*\", \"0.095\"]\n          - [\"Untrained\", \"last_preaction\", \"L32\", \"0.609\", \"0.609\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"Projector\", \"—\", \"—\", \"0.630\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual-panel: image_mean and last_preaction R² per-layer curves, trained (solid) vs untrained (dashed), with projector baseline horizontal line\"\n    analysis: >\n      R² scan 是连接 C1（framework）和 C2（routing）的桥梁实验。image_mean 的 training \n      invariance（Δ=0.015, small）支持 C1/C3；last_preaction 的 training effect \n      （Δ=0.069, p<0.0001）支持 C2 的 instruction routing narrative。\n      这一 dissociation 本身是论文的核心 insight：training 不改变 vision geometry \n      但 reshape instruction routing。\n\n  - name: \"CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: \"用 CLIP ViT-L/14 替代 SigLIP，区分 VL pretraining 贡献 vs encoder 本身质量\"\n    expected_results:\n      clip_cls_rsa: 0.557\n      clip_cls_R2: 0.587\n      dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n      dino_cls_R2: 0.634\n      projector_R2: 0.630\n      ordering: \"last_preaction_L19 (0.671) > DINO (0.634) ≈ Projector (0.630) > image_mean_L19 (0.599) > CLIP (0.587)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      CLIP RSA=0.557 和 R²=0.587 均低于 DINOv2（RSA=0.692, R²=0.634），\n      否定了 \"VL pretraining 优于 self-supervised\" 的假说。在 best 档下，\n      reviewers 接受这一结果说明 action-relevant geometry 更多来自 spatial/temporal \n      feature quality（DINOv2 的 self-supervised 目标天然对齐）而非 language-grounding \n      能力（CLIP 的 contrastive objective 不直接服务 action prediction）。\n      这为 C3 的 DINOv2 ranking observation 提供了额外的 interpretive depth：\n      DINOv2 的优势不是因为它 \"understand language\" 而是因为它的 patch-level \n      features 保留了更多 spatial-temporal structure。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Encoder Comparison (Unified Probe)\"\n        columns: [\"Encoder\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Action R²\", \"Pretraining\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DINOv2 cls\", \"0.692\", \"0.634\", \"Self-supervised (iBOT+DINO)\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP+Proj\", \"0.615\", \"0.630\", \"VL contrastive\"]\n          - [\"CLIP ViT-L cls\", \"0.557\", \"0.587\", \"VL contrastive\"]\n          - [\"VLA last_pre L19\", \"—\", \"0.671\", \"VLA finetuned\"]\n          - [\"VLA img_mean L19\", \"—\", \"0.599\", \"VLA finetuned\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar: RSA and R² side by side for each encoder, DINOv2 dominant in RSA\"\n    analysis: >\n      CLIP < DINO 在两个维度上成立。在 best 档下，这排除了 \"VL pretraining \n      is the key\" 解释，支持 \"spatial feature quality matters more than \n      language grounding for action prediction\" 的结论。\n\n  - name: \"Branch-Split RSA\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_013\"\n    description: \"在 DinoSigLIP fused backbone 中分离 DINOv2 branch (1088d) 和 SigLIP branch (1088d) 的 RSA\"\n    expected_results:\n      dinov2_branch_rsa: 0.619\n      siglip_branch_rsa: 0.621\n      fused_2176d_rsa: 0.634\n      post_projector_4096d_rsa: 0.615\n      standalone_dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n    result_rationale: >\n      DINOv2 branch (0.619) ≈ SigLIP branch (0.621)，Δ<0.002，说明在 fused backbone \n      中两个分支贡献几乎相等。Fused=0.634 > either branch (complementary benefit)，\n      projector 压缩 0.634→0.615（-0.019 的信息损失）。\n      Standalone DINO cls=0.692 > in-backbone DINOv2=0.619 的差异来自不同的 extraction layer \n      和 CLS vs patch-mean 的聚合方式差异。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 branch-split 分析作为 C3 observation 的 fine-grained \n      support：vision encoder 的两个分支互补而非冗余，projector 起到了 information bottleneck \n      的作用（轻微压缩但保持核心 structure）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Branch-Split RSA Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Representation\", \"Dim\", \"RSA (ρ)\", \"Δ vs Fused\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"DINOv2 branch (in-backbone)\", \"1088\", \"0.619\", \"-0.015\"]\n          - [\"SigLIP branch (in-backbone)\", \"1088\", \"0.621\", \"-0.013\"]\n          - [\"Fused backbone\", \"2176\", \"0.634\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Post-projector\", \"4096\", \"0.615\", \"-0.019\"]\n          - [\"Standalone DINOv2 cls\", \"1024\", \"0.692\", \"+0.058\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Waterfall chart: Fused (0.634) → Projector compression → LLM degradation → final VLA layer\"\n    analysis: >\n      两分支等贡献 + projector 轻微压缩 + LLM 进一步降解 = 完整的 information flow 图。\n      在 best 档下，这是 C1 framework 的 architectural decomposition，\n      让 reviewers 看到 action-relevant information 在每个 pipeline stage 的 fate。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Architecture R² Exit Collapse Matrix\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_arch_r2_collapse\"\n    description: \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 R² exit collapse 矩阵，验证 VLM→VLA 二元分离\"\n    expected_results:\n      vlm_to_vla_cells:\n        tracvla_goal: {trained_delta: 0.228, untrained_delta: 0.048, collapse: true}\n        tracvla_spatial: {trained_delta: 0.138, untrained_delta: 0.016, collapse: true}\n        tracvla_object: {trained_delta: 0.294, untrained_delta: 0.009, collapse: true}\n        tracvla_long: {trained_delta: 0.198, untrained_delta: 0.028, collapse: true}\n        nora_goal: {trained_delta: 0.691, untrained_delta: 0.044, collapse: true}\n        nora_spatial: {trained_delta: 0.302, untrained_delta: 0.037, collapse: true}\n      vla_to_vla_cells:\n        openvla_goal: {trained_delta: 0.016, untrained_delta: 0.033, collapse: false}\n        openvla_spatial: {trained_delta: 0.037, untrained_delta: 0.034, collapse: false}\n        openvla_object: {trained_delta: 0.037, untrained_delta: 0.076, collapse: false}\n        openvla_long: {trained_delta: 0.004, untrained_delta: 0.016, collapse: false}\n      binary_separation: \"6/6 VLM→VLA collapse vs 0/4 VLA→VLA collapse\"\n      threshold: 0.10\n      nlp_control_delta: 0.000\n    result_rationale: >\n      R² exit collapse 在 VLM→VLA 转换中 6/6 一致出现（TracVLA Δ=0.138-0.294, NORA Δ=0.302-0.691），\n      在 VLA→VLA 转换中 0/4 出现（OpenVLA Δ=0.004-0.037, 全部 < 0.10 threshold）。\n      NLP finetuning control ΔR²=0.000 排除了 generic fine-tuning artifact。\n      在 best 档下，这一 clean binary separation 被 reviewers 视为 novel mechanistic insight：\n      exit collapse 是 VLM→VLA transition 的 one-time representational reorganization，\n      反映了 action head 学习选择性丢弃 exit-layer action information 的过程。\n      一旦这个 reorganization 完成（OXE pretraining 阶段），进一步 task-specific finetuning \n      不再触发新的 collapse。Δ>0.10 threshold 基于 v3 MCCV（demo-level cross-validation \n      修正了 v2 的 train-test leakage），reviewers 不视为 arbitrary 因为它将两类转换 \n      完全分离。NORA Goal 的 Δ=0.691 是最极端的 collapse，可能与 Qwen2.5-VL-3B \n      的较小模型容量有关（更多 information 被压缩到 exit 层）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"R² Exit Collapse: VLM→VLA vs VLA→VLA Binary Separation\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Backbone\", \"Suite\", \"Transition Type\", \"Trained Δ\", \"Untrained Δ\", \"Collapse?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Goal\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.228\", \"0.048\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Spatial\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.138\", \"0.016\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Object\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.294\", \"0.009\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Long\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.198\", \"0.028\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\", \"Goal\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.691\", \"0.044\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\", \"Spatial\", \"VLM→VLA\", \"0.302\", \"0.037\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Goal\", \"VLA→VLA\", \"0.016\", \"0.033\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Spatial\", \"VLA→VLA\", \"0.037\", \"0.034\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Object\", \"VLA→VLA\", \"0.037\", \"0.076\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Long (OFT)\", \"VLA→VLA\", \"0.004\", \"0.016\", \"No\"]\n          - [\"NLP Control\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"—\", \"LLM→Chat\", \"0.000\", \"—\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: Trained Δ(peak-exit) for each cell, color-coded by transition type. Clear visual separation between VLM→VLA (tall bars) and VLA→VLA (flat bars).\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: Trained Δ on x-axis, colored by transition type, showing perfect linear separation at Δ=0.10\"\n    analysis: >\n      6/6 vs 0/4 + NLP control ΔR²=0.000 形成论文最强的跨架构 finding。\n      在 best 档下 (exit_collapse_reviewer_acceptance: 0.85-1.0)，\n      reviewers 接受这是 VLA training 的 emergent property，\n      而非特定架构或任务的 artifact。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Architecture Counterfactual Sensitivity\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_arch_cf\"\n    description: \"3 架构 × 4 suite 的 counterfactual perturbation 分析\"\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_same_metric_comparisons:\n        goal: {trained_d: 1.182, untrained_d: 1.048, delta: 0.134, metric: \"cohen_d\"}\n        spatial: {trained_d: 1.173, untrained_d: 0.936, delta: 0.237, metric: \"cohen_d\"}\n      tracvla_trained_d_range: [1.17, 1.52]\n      tracvla_untrained_cos_range: [0.153, 0.185]\n      nora_trained: \"cos=1.0 (saturated)\"\n      nora_untrained_cos: 0.081\n      metric_incomparability_count: \"5/8 cross-arch cells\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      CF sensitivity 一致存在于所有 trained VLAs（Cohen's d ≥ 0.45 across all tested conditions），\n      但 metric incomparability 限制了跨条件定量比较。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受：\n      (1) OpenVLA 是唯一可做公平 trained-vs-untrained 比较的架构（两个条件都能生成 actions，\n      用同一 Cohen's d metric），结果 trained 高于 untrained 但 gap 适中（Δ=0.04-0.24），\n      因为 OXE-pretrained untrained 已是训练过的 VLA；\n      (2) TracVLA/NORA 的 trained 用 d（action space），untrained 用 cos（hidden space），\n      两者不可比，但论文 properly caveat 这一点而非 overclaim；\n      (3) \"empty\" 在 6/8 trained settings 排第一（最大 perturbation = 完全移除 instruction），\n      这一 consistent ordering 跨架构成立，支持 instruction routing 的 functional 解读。\n      CF sensitivity reviewer acceptance 在 best 档为 70-90%——部分 reviewers \n      可能对 metric incomparability 有保留，但 proper caveating 化解了大多数担忧。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Counterfactual Sensitivity: Fair Comparisons (OpenVLA, same metric)\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Trained top d\", \"Untrained top d\", \"Δ\", \"Trained top condition\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Goal\", \"1.182 (wrong)\", \"1.048 (empty)\", \"+0.134\", \"wrong\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"1.173 (empty)\", \"0.936 (empty)\", \"+0.237\", \"empty\"]\n          - [\"Object\", \"1.210 (empty)\", \"cos=0.569*\", \"incommensurable\", \"empty\"]\n          - [\"Long (OFT)\", \"0.565 (shuffled)\", \"—\", \"—\", \"shuffled\"]\n      - title: \"Counterfactual Sensitivity: Cross-Architecture (trained only)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Suite\", \"Top d/cos\", \"Top Condition\", \"Metric\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Goal\", \"d=1.182\", \"wrong\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"d=1.173\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Goal\", \"d=1.524\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Spatial\", \"d=1.327\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Object\", \"d=1.212\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Long\", \"d=1.473\", \"empty\", \"Cohen's d\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Goal\", \"cos=1.0\", \"saturated\", \"cosine dist\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: architecture × suite, cell color = Cohen's d magnitude, with metric type annotation\"\n    analysis: >\n      CF sensitivity 的跨架构一致性支持 C2 routing narrative。在 best 档下，\n      metric incomparability 被 properly caveated 后不构成 fatal objection，\n      因为 OpenVLA 的 within-metric comparison 已足够作为 fair evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient\"\n    plan_id: \"three_tier_gradient\"\n    description: \"VLM base → OXE-pretrained VLA → task-finetuned VLA 的三层级 routing 梯度验证\"\n    expected_results:\n      tier1_vlm_base:\n        r2_exit_collapse: \"None (0/2)\"\n        cf_sensitivity: \"cos < 0.2 (TracVLA/NORA untrained)\"\n        l1_heads: \"base-model-dependent (Phi-3: 32/32, Qwen: 13/16)\"\n      tier2_oxe_pretrained:\n        r2_exit_collapse: \"None (0/4 OpenVLA cells < 0.10)\"\n        cf_sensitivity: \"d=1.048 (strong, same metric comparison)\"\n        l1_heads: \"25/32 (OpenVLA untrained)\"\n      tier3_task_finetuned:\n        r2_exit_collapse: \"6/6 VLM→VLA cells > 0.10\"\n        cf_sensitivity: \"d ≥ 1.17 (TracVLA/NORA trained)\"\n        l1_heads: \"architecture-dependent (22-30/32)\"\n      routing_progression: \"No routing → General routing (OXE) → Task-specific routing (LIBERO)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      三层级梯度是论文的 narrative spine。在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这一 staged \n      emergence story：(1) VLM base（Phi-3-Vision, Qwen2.5-VL）无 action training，\n      无 exit collapse，CF sensitivity 极低（cos<0.2），L1 heads 完全来自语言预训练；\n      (2) OXE-pretrained VLA（openvla-7b, 970K episodes）已有强 L1 routing（25/32 heads），\n      强 CF（d=1.048），但无 exit collapse——说明 OXE training 创建了 routing \n      但尚未触发 exit-layer reorganization；\n      (3) Task-finetuned VLA（TracVLA/NORA）在 VLM→VLA 转换时触发 exit collapse，\n      CF sensitivity 进一步增强，h13/h22 mixed heads emerge (TracVLA)。\n      关键区分：L1 head count 是 base-model-dependent（Phi-3 的 instruction tuning \n      已创建 32/32 heads，训练反而减少到 27-30/32），而 R² collapse 和 CF sensitivity \n      是 training-induced。这一 honest distinction 在 best 档下被视为 \n      methodological sophistication，而非 weakness。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Three-Tier Routing Gradient\"\n        columns: [\"Tier\", \"Example\", \"R² Collapse\", \"CF Sensitivity\", \"L1 Heads\", \"Routing\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Tier 1: VLM base\", \"Phi-3-Vision\", \"None\", \"cos<0.2\", \"32/32 (pretrained)\", \"Language-only\"]\n          - [\"Tier 1: VLM base\", \"Qwen2.5-VL\", \"None\", \"cos=0.081\", \"13/16 (pretrained)\", \"Language-only\"]\n          - [\"Tier 2: OXE VLA\", \"openvla-7b\", \"None (Δ<0.10)\", \"d=1.048\", \"25/32\", \"General action\"]\n          - [\"Tier 3: Task VLA\", \"TracVLA-Goal\", \"Δ=0.228\", \"d=1.524\", \"27/32\", \"Task-specific\"]\n          - [\"Tier 3: Task VLA\", \"NORA-Goal\", \"Δ=0.691\", \"cos=1.0*\", \"13/16\", \"Task-specific\"]\n          - [\"Control: NLP\", \"Llama-2-chat\", \"ΔR²=0.000\", \"N/A\", \"N/A\", \"None (language only)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Schematic: three tiers as pipeline stages, each tier annotated with R² collapse status, CF magnitude, and L1 head count\"\n    analysis: >\n      三层级梯度将 exit collapse、CF sensitivity、L1 heads 统一在一个 developmental narrative 中。\n      在 best 档下，这是论文从 \"observation collection\" 升级到 \"mechanistic story\" 的关键。\n\n  - name: \"NLP Finetuning Control\"\n    plan_id: \"nlp_control\"\n    description: \"Llama-2-7b-chat（SFT+RLHF）+ Phi-3-mini-instruct + Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct 的 R² profile，排除 generic finetuning artifact\"\n    expected_results:\n      llama2_chat:\n        mean_r2: 0.1553\n        r2_range: [0.1547, 0.1555]\n        delta_r2: 0.000\n        profile: \"flat constant across all 32 layers\"\n      phi3_instruct:\n        mean_r2: 0.1555\n        r2_range: [0.1552, 0.1555]\n        delta_r2: 0.000\n      qwen25_instruct:\n        mean_r2: 0.1554\n        r2_range: [0.1550, 0.1555]\n        delta_r2: 0.000\n      interpretation: \"R² ≈ 0.155 is noise floor; NLP finetuning creates zero layer-differentiated action representation\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      三个 NLP-finetuned models 在所有层 R²≈0.155（noise floor，仅拟合 between-task variance），\n      ΔR²=0.000。对比同 backbone 的 VLM→VLA 转换：TracVLA Δ=0.156-0.294，NORA Δ=0.302-0.691。\n      在 best 档下（A6 假设），reviewers 接受这是 strong evidence 排除 \"exit collapse \n      is a generic fine-tuning artifact\"。逻辑链：(1) 同 backbone（Llama-2-7B）+ \n      不同 finetuning（NLP chat vs VLA action）= 只有 VLA 产生 exit collapse；\n      (2) 不同 backbone（Llama-2, Phi-3, Qwen2.5）+ 同 finetuning 类型（NLP instruction tuning）\n      = 三个都没有 exit collapse。这双重排除了 backbone-specific 和 finetuning-generic 两种 \n      alternative explanations。R²=0.155 的物理含义是 ridge regression 只从 between-task \n      variance（10 classes → ~10% base + inter-task feature differences）中拟合，\n      无 layer-specific action information。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"NLP Finetuning Control: R² Exit Collapse Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Backbone\", \"Finetuning\", \"Peak R²\", \"Exit R²\", \"ΔR²\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Llama-2-7b-chat\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"SFT+RLHF (NLP)\", \"0.1555\", \"0.1555\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"Phi-3-mini-instruct\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Instruction tuning (NLP)\", \"0.1555\", \"0.1555\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct\", \"Qwen2.5-3B\", \"Instruction tuning (NLP)\", \"0.1555\", \"0.1555\", \"0.000\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA (trained)\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"VLA (VLM→VLA)\", \"0.839\", \"0.574\", \"0.265*\"]\n          - [\"NORA (trained)\", \"Qwen2.5-VL-3B\", \"VLA (VLM→VLA)\", \"0.697\", \"-0.004\", \"0.701*\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA (trained)\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"VLA (VLA→VLA)\", \"0.869\", \"0.853\", \"0.016\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-layer R² plot: three NLP controls as flat lines at 0.155, overlaid with VLA trained curves showing inverted-U + exit collapse\"\n    analysis: >\n      NLP control 是论文的 specificity killshot。在 best 档下，\n      这一三 backbone 一致的 null result 让 \"generic finetuning\" \n      和 \"backbone-specific\" 两种 alternative explanations 同时被排除。\n\n  - name: \"L1 Instruction-Dominant Head Analysis (Cross-Architecture)\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_arch_l1_heads\"\n    description: \"三架构 × 多 suite 的 L1 attention head 分析，区分 training-induced vs base-model-dependent\"\n    expected_results:\n      openvla:\n        trained_goal: 23\n        untrained_goal: 26\n        trained_object: 24\n        untrained_object: 24\n        interpretation: \"OXE pretraining 已创建 routing; finetuning 减少 heads (→mixed)\"\n      tracvla:\n        trained_range: [27, 30]\n        untrained_all: 32\n        interpretation: \"Phi-3-Vision 32/32; training 减少到 27-30 (repurpose)\"\n      nora:\n        trained_goal: 13\n        untrained_goal: 13\n        trained_spatial: 12\n        untrained_spatial: 14\n        interpretation: \"Qwen2.5-VL 预训练已 13/16\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      L1 head count 的跨架构比较清楚地表明这是 base-model-dependent 而非 training-induced：\n      TracVLA untrained（纯 Phi-3-Vision）已 32/32 instruction-dominant，训练反而减少到 27-30/32；\n      NORA trained ≈ untrained（13/16 vs 13-14/16）；OpenVLA untrained（OXE pretrained）\n      已 25-26/32。在 best 档下（A5 假设），reviewers 将 \"what training creates vs \n      what it inherits\" 的区分视为 honest science——论文不 overclaim L1 heads 是训练效果，\n      而是准确归因为 base model 的语言预训练 attention pattern。\n      这种 intellectual honesty 提升而非降低论文的可信度。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads: Training vs Inheritance\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Backbone\", \"Suite\", \"Trained\", \"Untrained\", \"Δ\", \"Source\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Goal\", \"23/32\", \"26/32 (OXE)\", \"-3\", \"Base+OXE\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"Llama-2-7B\", \"Object\", \"24/32\", \"24/32 (OXE)\", \"0\", \"Base+OXE\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Goal\", \"27/32\", \"32/32 (VLM)\", \"-5\", \"Base VLM\"]\n          - [\"TracVLA\", \"Phi-3-mini\", \"Object\", \"30/32\", \"32/32 (VLM)\", \"-2\", \"Base VLM\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Qwen2.5-VL\", \"Goal\", \"13/16\", \"13/16 (VLM)\", \"0\", \"Base VLM\"]\n          - [\"NORA\", \"Qwen2.5-VL\", \"Spatial\", \"12/16\", \"14/16 (VLM)\", \"-2\", \"Base VLM\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar: trained vs untrained L1 heads per architecture, showing that untrained ≥ trained in most cases\"\n    analysis: >\n      Training 不增加 L1 heads——在多数情况下反而减少（repurpose some heads to mixed function）。\n      在 best 档下，这一 counter-intuitive finding 被视为 nuanced insight，\n      强化了论文区分 training effect 和 inherited property 的贡献。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Instruction Probe (Dense Layer Profile)\"\n    plan_id: \"cross_inst_probe\"\n    description: \"10-way instruction classification × 33 layers × 3 conditions（trained/untrained/Llama-2 base），验证 instruction routing 的逐层 dynamics\"\n    expected_results:\n      trained_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.10\n        L1: 0.996\n        L2_to_L32: 1.000\n        pattern: \"immediate routing — L1 saturates\"\n      llama2base_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.10\n        L1: 0.802\n        L2: 0.987\n        L5_plus: 1.000\n        pattern: \"gradual buildup — saturates at L5\"\n      untrained_last_preaction:\n        L0: 0.10\n        L1: 1.000\n        L8: 0.986\n        L16: 0.923\n        L24: 0.864\n        L31: 0.820\n        pattern: \"accidental routing + gradual forgetting\"\n      image_mean_all_conditions: 0.10\n      loocv_trained: \"100.00±0.00\"\n      loocv_untrained: \"96.64±7.07 → 84.76±11.59\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      三条件的 cross-instruction probe 揭示了三种定性不同的 routing 策略：\n      (1) Trained 在 L1 即达 99.6% → 全程 100%——VLA training 创建了 immediate dedicated routing，\n      instruction identity 在第一层就被提取并全程保持；\n      (2) Llama-2 base 从 L1=80.2% 逐渐升至 L5=100%——语言预训练创建了 gradual processing，\n      instruction 需要多层处理才能被 fully resolve，但一旦 resolve 就稳定保持；\n      (3) Untrained（random init）L1=100% 看似最好，但 L31=82%——\"偶然路由\"因 high-dim \n      random features 的 trivial separability 在 L1 成功，但 random weight 的 noise accumulation \n      导致 signal 逐层衰减。\n      Image_mean 在所有条件下都是 10%（chance），确认 causal mask 阻止了 image→instruction \n      information flow。在 best 档下，这一 three-way comparison 是 C2 的 definitive evidence，\n      展示了 VLA training 的 unique contribution（immediacy + stability）vs pretrained \n      language processing（gradual + stable）vs random baseline（accidental + decaying）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Instruction Classification: Three Routing Strategies\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"VLA Trained\", \"Llama-2 Base\", \"Untrained (Random)\", \"Image Mean (all)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0\", \"10%\", \"10%\", \"10%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L1\", \"99.6%\", \"80.2%\", \"100%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L2\", \"100%\", \"98.7%\", \"100%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L5\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"99.x%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L8\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"98.6%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L16\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"92.3%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L24\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"86.4%\", \"10%\"]\n          - [\"L31\", \"100%\", \"100%\", \"82.0%\", \"10%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-line plot: instruction classification accuracy across 33 layers. Trained=flat at 100%, Llama-2 base=rising to 100% by L5, Untrained=declining from 100% to 82%\"\n    analysis: >\n      三条件 probe profile 是论文最 visually compelling 的 figure 之一。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 一眼就能看到 three qualitatively different strategies，\n      这是 C2 claim \"VLA fine-tuning achieves immediate dedicated routing\" 的 direct evidence。\n\n  - name: \"L1 Attention Three-Condition Profile\"\n    plan_id: \"l1_attention_three_cond\"\n    description: \"L1 attention pattern 的 untrained/Llama-2 base/VLA trained 三条件对比\"\n    expected_results:\n      untrained:\n        text_attention: 0.117\n        image_attention: 0.878\n        instruction_dominant_heads: 0\n      llama2base:\n        text_attention: 0.365\n        image_attention: 0.617\n        instruction_dominant_heads: 9\n      trained:\n        text_attention: 0.577\n        image_attention: 0.213\n        instruction_dominant_heads: 24\n      per_token_normalized_ratio:\n        trained_instr_dom: 38.2\n        untrained: 1.5\n        training_amplification: 25.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      L1 attention 的三条件梯度（0→9→24 instruction-dominant heads, 12%→37%→58% text attention）\n      是 C2 的 mechanistic evidence。Per-token normalization（考虑 ~11.5x image/text \n      token count asymmetry）后，trained instruction-dominant heads 的 text/image ratio \n      达 38.2x（vs untrained 1.5x），说明 training 创建了 extreme instruction specialization。\n      在 best 档下，这一 gradient 与 cross-instruction probe 的 three strategies \n      在 mechanistic level 对应：(1) untrained 0 heads → 无 instruction processing capacity；\n      (2) Llama-2 base 9 heads → 中等语言处理能力（mid-layer inverted-U）；\n      (3) VLA trained 24 heads → immediate instruction capture（L1 saturated probe）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"L1 Attention Pattern: Three-Condition Gradient\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Untrained\", \"Llama-2 Base\", \"VLA Trained\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Attention to text/instruction\", \"11.7%\", \"36.5%\", \"57.7%\"]\n          - [\"Attention to image\", \"87.8%\", \"61.7%\", \"21.3%\"]\n          - [\"Instruction-dominant heads (>50%)\", \"0/32\", \"9/32\", \"24/32\"]\n          - [\"Per-token text/image ratio\", \"1.5x\", \"—\", \"38.2x\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar or pie charts: attention distribution at L1 for three conditions\"\n    analysis: >\n      0→9→24 gradient 是 C2 headline finding 的 most concise summary。\n      在 best 档下，per-token normalization 排除了 token-count confound，\n      strengthening the claim that training creates genuine instruction specialization。\n\n  - name: \"32-Layer Dense Attention Profile\"\n    plan_id: \"dense_attention_profile\"\n    description: \"全 32 层 × 三条件的 instruction-dominant head count profile\"\n    expected_results:\n      untrained_pattern: \"0 heads at all 32 layers — no language processing capacity\"\n      llama2base_pattern: \"Inverted-U — L0-L4 low (0-10) → L9-L16 peak (15-22) → L31 decline (8)\"\n      trained_pattern: \"Bookend — L0-L1 peak (21-24) → L2-L30 valley (0-11) → L31 re-engagement (18)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Dense 32-layer profile 是 C2 的 strongest mechanistic evidence：\n      VLA training 将 instruction attention 从 Llama-2 base 的 mid-layer processing \n      模式（inverted-U, peak L9-L16）reorganize 到 bookend 模式（entry L0-L1 + exit L31）。\n      这一 temporal reorganization 与 cross-instruction probe 在 functional level 一致：\n      trained model 在 entry 层 capture instruction（L1=99.6%）并在 exit 层 re-engage \n      for action conditioning（L31 18 heads）。\n      在 best 档下，bookend pattern 被解读为 efficient routing architecture：\n      entry 层 extract instruction identity，mid-layers 用于 vision-dominated computation，\n      exit 层 re-inject instruction signal for action generation。\n      Llama-2 base 的 inverted-U 是经典 LM pattern（mid-layer deep semantic processing），\n      VLA training 保留了总体 attention capacity 但 redistribute 了 temporal allocation。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Dense Attention Profile: Representative Layers\"\n        columns: [\"Layer\", \"Untrained\", \"Llama-2 Base\", \"VLA Trained\", \"Trained Pattern\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"L0\", \"0\", \"2\", \"21\", \"Entry peak\"]\n          - [\"L1\", \"0\", \"4\", \"24\", \"Entry peak\"]\n          - [\"L4\", \"0\", \"8\", \"5\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L9\", \"0\", \"18\", \"3\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L12\", \"0\", \"22\", \"1\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L16\", \"0\", \"20\", \"4\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L24\", \"0\", \"12\", \"7\", \"Valley\"]\n          - [\"L31\", \"0\", \"8\", \"18\", \"Exit re-engagement\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-panel line plot: instruction-dominant head count across 32 layers for each condition. Bookend vs inverted-U vs flat-zero patterns clearly distinguishable.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Mid-layer inverted-U → bookend reorganization 是论文的 narrative centerpiece。\n      在 best 档下，这一 visualization 是 Figure 1 或 Figure 2 的核心 panel，\n      让 reviewers 直观理解 VLA training 的 routing reorganization。\n\n  - name: \"Counterfactual Action Trajectory Analysis (OpenVLA)\"\n    plan_id: \"cf_trajectory_analysis\"\n    description: \"L1 head ablation 对 action output 的影响：Cohen's d, MSE, token divergence, GT error\"\n    expected_results:\n      head_ablation_top24:\n        cohens_d: 0.651\n        trajectory_d: 2.943\n        paired_mse: 0.042\n        token_divergence: 0.723\n        delta_gt_mse: -0.001\n      specificity_ratio: 1.08\n      gt_error_delta: \"ΔMSE ≈ 0 (p=0.519)\"\n      token_overlap_spearman: 1.0\n    result_rationale: >\n      Ablating 24 instruction-dominant heads 在 L1 产生 d=0.651 的 action shift，\n      trajectory level d=2.943（~4.5x inflation due to within-trajectory correlation）。\n      关键 finding：ΔMSE_vs_GT ≈ 0（p=0.519），说明 ablation redirects action outputs \n      without degrading accuracy。在 best 档下，这一 information-computation dissociation \n      被解读为 instruction heads 控制 action direction（哪个 action space region）\n      而非 action quality（与 ground truth 的距离）。\n      Specificity ratio 1.08x（instruction 24 heads vs random 24 heads）modest，\n      但 per-head analysis 显示 control heads 有 ~1.9x per-head effect，\n      instruction heads 通过 24-head collective coordination 产生更大 total effect。\n      Token overlap Spearman ρ=1.0 确认 CF sensitivity 与 lexical/positional novelty \n      而非 semantic distance 相关——这是 honest caveat，论文不 overclaim semantic processing。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Counterfactual Action Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Instruction 24h Ablation\", \"Control 8h Ablation\", \"Ratio\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Cohen's d (token)\", \"0.651\", \"0.410\", \"1.59\"]\n          - [\"Trajectory d\", \"2.943\", \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Paired MSE\", \"0.042\", \"0.020\", \"2.07\"]\n          - [\"Token divergence\", \"0.723\", \"0.293\", \"2.47\"]\n          - [\"KL divergence\", \"5.079\", \"1.690\", \"3.00\"]\n          - [\"GT MSE delta\", \"-0.001 (n.s.)\", \"+0.008 (n.s.)\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Per-head d\", \"0.027\", \"0.051\", \"0.53\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual panel: (A) token-level d comparison instruction vs control, (B) GT MSE showing no degradation\"\n    analysis: >\n      ΔMSE≈0 是 C2 的关键 evidence for information-computation dissociation。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 接受 \"open-loop functional sensitivity\" framing——\n      instruction heads modulate output direction without systematic quality change。\n\n  - name: \"Training Trajectory (4-condition)\"\n    plan_id: \"training_trajectory\"\n    description: \"untrained → llama2base → bridge-vla → libero-finetuned 的 L1 attention 和 probe 演化轨迹\"\n    expected_results:\n      l1_heads_progression:\n        untrained: 0\n        llama2base: 9\n        bridge_vla: 24\n        libero_finetuned: 22\n      l31_exit_engagement:\n        bridge_vla: 18\n        libero_finetuned: 0\n      probe_accuracy_L31:\n        bridge_vla: 1.0\n        libero_finetuned: 1.0\n      attention_representation_dissociation: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      4-condition trajectory 展示 routing 的 developmental history：\n      (1) Entry routing 在 OXE pretraining 时 emerge（0→24 heads），task finetuning \n      略减（24→22）但基本稳定；\n      (2) Exit engagement L31 从 bridge-vla 的 18 heads 到 libero-finetuned 的 0 heads——\n      entry-exit bookend → entry-only sharpening；\n      (3) Probe accuracy 在 L31 保持 100%（两个条件都是），确认 attention-representation \n      dissociation：exit attention 消失但 representational capacity 不变。\n      在 best 档下，这一 dissociation 被视为 refinement 而非 contradiction——\n      LIBERO finetuning sharpens routing to entry-only while maintaining representational \n      capacity at exit through residual stream。\n\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Training Trajectory: 4-Condition L1 Evolution\"\n        columns: [\"Stage\", \"L1 Heads\", \"L31 Heads\", \"L31 Probe Acc\", \"Interpretation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Random init\", \"0/32\", \"0/32\", \"82%\", \"No routing\"]\n          - [\"Llama-2 base\", \"9/32\", \"8/32\", \"100%\", \"Language processing\"]\n          - [\"OXE-pretrained (bridge)\", \"24/32\", \"18/32\", \"100%\", \"Bookend routing\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-finetuned\", \"22/32\", \"0/32\", \"100%\", \"Entry-only sharpening\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Developmental timeline: L1 and L31 head counts across four training stages\"\n    analysis: >\n      Attention-representation dissociation at L31 是 subtle but important finding。\n      在 best 档下，reviewers 接受这是 training 的 efficiency optimization：\n      从 bookend 到 entry-only，因为 residual stream 已足够 maintain information。\n\n  - name: \"TracVLA Universal Mixed Heads (h13, h22)\"\n    plan_id: \"tracvla_mixed_heads\"\n    description: \"TracVLA 中 h13 和 h22 在全部 4 suites 的 trained 模型中一致作为 mixed head 出现\"\n    expected_results:\n      h13_status_all_suites: \"mixed (non-instruction-dominant, non-image-dominant)\"\n      h22_status_all_suites: \"mixed\"\n      untrained_mixed_heads: \"none (32/32 instruction-dominant)\"\n      consistency: \"4/4 suites\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      h13 和 h22 在 TracVLA 的全部 4 个 LIBERO suite 中一致从 instruction-dominant \n      变为 mixed，而 untrained（Phi-3-Vision）无此 pattern（32/32 全 instruction-dominant）。\n      在 best 档下，这被解读为 training 创建了 functionally specialized mixed-modality heads——\n      这些 heads 可能负责 cross-modal integration（同时处理 image 和 instruction information），\n      而非单一 modality 的 routing。跨 suite 一致性排除了 task-specific artifact。\n      论文不 overclaim 具体功能（\"may perform cross-modal integration\"），\n      这种 measured language 在 best 档下被视为 appropriate caution。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"TracVLA Mixed Heads Across Suites\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Trained Instr-Dom\", \"Trained Mixed\", \"Untrained Instr-Dom\", \"h13 Status\", \"h22 Status\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Goal\", \"27/32\", \"5\", \"32/32\", \"mixed\", \"mixed\"]\n          - [\"Spatial\", \"30/32\", \"2\", \"32/32\", \"mixed\", \"mixed\"]\n          - [\"Object\", \"30/32\", \"2\", \"32/32\", \"mixed\", \"mixed\"]\n          - [\"Long\", \"30/32\", \"2\", \"32/32\", \"mixed\", \"mixed\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Head-level attention heatmap: 32 heads × 4 suites, h13 and h22 highlighted as consistently mixed\"\n    analysis: >\n      Universal mixed heads 是 TracVLA-specific observation，补充 C2 的 cross-architecture narrative。\n      在 best 档下，这是 interesting finding 但不是 core claim 的依赖项。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ed7c8a67-c6c1-41f1-9dd1-3c36c2bc23db","total_cost_usd":1.17328505,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":62891,"cache_read_input_tokens":210201,"output_tokens":22599,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":62891,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":22170,"cache_read_input_tokens":67146,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7586},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":48581,"outputTokens":1849,"cacheReadInputTokens":76123,"cacheCreationInputTokens":35742,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.1101158,"contextWi